9","id":245881270,"login":"sraj1009","node_id":"U_kgDODqfZtg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/commits/c268bdd523c72c30521e615476141fed427707c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T03:20:52Z","email":"mshriraj1009@gmail.com","name":"sraj1009"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T03:20:52Z","email":"mshriraj1009@gmail.com","name":"sraj1009"},"message":"💳 Multi-step checkout payment method with honeycomb progress\n\n## 🎨 Payment Method Selection UI\n- Step 3 of 4 checkout process with honeycomb progress indicator\n- 4 connected hexagons: completed (green), current (honey-gold), pending (gray)\n- Payment options: UPI/GPay (recommended), Credit/Debit Card, Cash on Delivery\n- 80px icons with radio selection and provider descriptions\n\n## 📱 Interactive Payment Cards\n- Selectable cards with 1px borders and radio buttons\n- Selected state: honey-gold border (2px), checkmark icon, subtle glow\n- Recommended badge for UPI/GPay option\n- Hover effects with elevation and shadow changes\n\n## 📄 Receipt Upload Section\n- Drag-and-drop zone with dashed border for COD payments\n- File type validation: PNG, JPG, PDF (max 5MB)\n- Upload progress bar with percentage indicator\n- Success/error states with appropriate visual feedback\n\n## ✅ Form Validation & States\n- Real-time validation with TypeScript schema\n- Success states (green check), error states (red text + icon)\n- Loading states with spinner animations\n- Continue button disabled until requirements met\n\n## 🔒 Security & Trust Features\n- SSL secured, 256-bit encryption badges\n- Trusted by 10,000+ families indicator\n- Manual verification within 2 hours promise\n- 100% secure transaction guarantee\n\n## 🎯 Professional Fintech UI\n- Stripe-level polish and interactions\n- 16px input fields with floating labels\n- Honey-gradient continue button with state transitions\n- Keyboard navigation support with focus indicators\n\n## 📐 Design System Compliance\n- Tailwind form plugin styling\n- TypeScript form validation schema\n- Accessibility WCAG 2.1 AA compliant\n- Mobile responsive layout with proper touch targets\n\n## 🏗️ Technical Implementation\n- React useState hooks with form management\n- Drag-and-drop file handling with progress tracking\n- Form validation with error handling\n- Component composition with proper prop types\n\nImpact: Creates a premium, fintech-grade checkout experience with professional polish and comprehensive payment options.","tree":{"sha":"1b016a0ac7faee7c23dbff409fd7c8e6ea6f9015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/trees/1b016a0ac7faee7c23dbff409fd7c8e6ea6f9015"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/commits/c268bdd523c72c30521e615476141fed427707c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245881270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sraj1009","id":245881270,"login":"sraj1009","node_id":"U_kgDODqfZtg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user