E7) palette\n- Deep forest green (#2D5016) accents for nature-inspired branding\n\n## 🌟 Premium Features\n- Central hero with floating glass card (backdrop-filter: blur(12px))\n- Premium educational books and artisan honey jars showcase\n- Hexagonal honeycomb grid background pattern\n- Clean Inter/Poppins typography with generous whitespace\n- Honey-gradient CTA button (#FFB347 to #FFA500) with 16px radius\n\n## 📱 Mobile-First Responsive Design\n- Touch-friendly 48px minimum tap targets\n- Responsive typography with clamp() functions\n- Mobile-optimized layout and interactions\n- Smooth scrolling and custom scrollbar\n\n## 🎯 Interactive Elements\n- Mouse-responsive parallax effects\n- Floating product cards with animations\n- Lucide-style line icons for navigation\n- Hover states and micro-interactions\n- Shimmer effects on buttons\n\n## 🏗️ Technical Implementation\n- React component structure with TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS utility classes\n- Custom CSS animations and effects\n- 8K resolution ready design system\n- Figma-quality component architecture\n\n## 📦 Dependencies Added\n- lucide-react: Premium icon library\n- Custom glassmorphic CSS utilities\n- Responsive design tokens\n\nImpact: Transforms the landing page into a premium, modern e-commerce experience with professional portfolio quality design.","tree":{"sha":"5ff4c2078a64dd45e40e9c5347f501a4b7e4c2d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/trees/5ff4c2078a64dd45e40e9c5347f501a4b7e4c2d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/commits/4f1883de78e2ac3704bf8a669eb23e8b63629b06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245881270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/following{/other_