/sraj1009/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/commits/232aa43994f5fcc6b3d43633d2e556e739757dd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T16:42:47Z","email":"mshriraj1009@gmail.com","name":"sraj1009"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T16:42:47Z","email":"mshriraj1009@gmail.com","name":"sraj1009"},"message":"🧪 Fix testing infrastructure and separate frontend/backend tests\n\n## Frontend Testing Fixes\n- Fix API mocking in App.test.tsx to prevent hook errors\n- Add comprehensive mocks for services and hooks\n- Create separate frontend test configuration\n- Exclude server directory from frontend tests\n\n## Backend Testing\n- Backend tests working independently with Jest\n- All auth controller tests passing (2/2)\n- Proper database and authentication setup\n\n## Test Scripts\n- Add separate test scripts for frontend and backend\n- npm test: Frontend tests only (Vitest)\n- npm run test:backend: Backend tests only (Jest)\n- npm run test:watch: Frontend watch mode\n- npm run test:coverage: Frontend coverage\n\n## Results\n- ✅ Frontend: 2 tests passing\n- ✅ Backend: 2 tests passing\n- ✅ No crypto module conflicts\n- ✅ Proper test isolation\n\nTesting infrastructure now fully functional!","tree":{"sha":"6fdf2f7a9289a1b32fbd7e981065953afb27edf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/trees/6fdf2f7a9289a1b32fbd7e981065953afb27edf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/commits/232aa43994f5fcc6b3d43633d2e556e739757dd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245881270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g