"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sraj1009","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/commits/04d116c8c60f1fc579de45132a7d8da36a1d716a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T16:35:00Z","email":"mshriraj1009@gmail.com","name":"sraj1009"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T16:35:00Z","email":"mshriraj1009@gmail.com","name":"sraj1009"},"message":"🔒 Critical security fixes and major architecture improvements\n\n## Security Fixes\n- Re-enable rate limiting to prevent API abuse and brute force attacks\n- Implement strict SameSite cookie settings for enhanced CSRF protection\n- Verify GEMINI_API_KEY security (already properly secured on backend)\n\n## Reliability Enhancements\n- Add React Error Boundaries for graceful error handling\n- Prevent app crashes with user-friendly fallback UI\n\n## Architecture Improvements\n- Refactor AdminDashboard from 1016 lines to modular components\n- Split into focused components: Sidebar, Overview, Orders, Products, Customers\n- Improve maintainability and follow single responsibility principle\n\n## Testing Infrastructure\n- Add Vitest + React Testing Library setup\n- Configure test environment with proper mocks\n- Create initial test suite for App component\n\n## Build & Performance\n- Update build configuration with testing support\n- Optimize bundle size and PWA generation\n- All builds passing successfully\n\nImpact: Significantly improved security, reliability, and maintainability","tree":{"sha":"db949f79b58b225a1f6c5caf7e56e3ed69d7b0ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/trees/db949f79b58b225a1f6c5caf7e56e3ed69d7b0ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sraj1009/SB-website/git/commits/04d116c8c60f1fc579de