VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ediakli448/Restyler-Claude/commits/a85bc5d3f0c4876a32c96a17d60639411a15f148/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T11:40:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T11:40:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Refactor architecture for Vercel Serverless deployment and Client-Orchestrated Queue\n\n- Replace Express backend + React frontend with unified Next.js 14 App Router\n- Implement client-orchestrated chunk queue: browser sends one chunk at a time\n  to stateless serverless API routes, respecting rate limits between calls\n- No single API request exceeds Vercel''s 60s timeout limit\n- API routes: /api/upload (parse PDF/DOCX), /api/extract-style (Style Master-Guide),\n  /api/restyle-chunk (one LLM call per request)\n- Client-side: chunking, image injection, HTML assembly, progress tracking\n- API key remains server-side only (process.env in serverless functions)\n- Images returned as base64 data-URIs (no filesystem dependency for Vercel)\n- All core requirements preserved: zero information loss, BiDi RTL/LTR,\n  reference style engine, image extraction/injection\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01VangytH8DhEu4NDFFJeduF","tree":{"sha":"37b6d4ecb92f914e06792686e32e12bc65a83bce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ediakli448/Restyler-Claude/git/trees/37b6d4ecb92f914e06792686e32e12bc65a83bce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ediakli448/Restyler-Claude/git/commits/a85bc5d3f0c4876a32c96a17d60639411a15f148","verification":{"payload":"tree 37b6d4ecb92f914e06792686e32e12bc65a83bce\nparent 758cdd5c72503befdaddad6b9eb09588bdb04538\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772970030 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772970030 +0000\n\nRefactor architecture for Vercel Serverless deployment and Client-Orchestrated Queue\n\n- Replace Express backend + React frontend with unified Next.js 14 App Router\n- Implement client-orchestrated chunk queue: browser sends one chunk at a time\n  to stateless serverless API routes, respecting rate limits between calls\n- No single API request exceeds Vercel''s 60s timeout limit\n- API routes: /api/upload (parse PDF/DOCX), /api/extract-style (Style Master-Guide),\n  /api/restyle-chunk (one LLM call per request)\n- Client-side: chunking, image injection, HTML assembly, progress tracking\n- API key remains server-side only (process.env in serverless functions)\n- Images returned as base64 data-URIs (no filesystem dependency for Vercel)\n- All core requirements preserved: zero information loss, BiDi RTL/LTR,\n  reference style engine, image extraction/injection\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01VangytH8DhEu4NDFFJeduF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOQwvQfv\nkISfDMmJOOVySbFBsfmLbV/6oCf7uhVyBsnBneoGb3fds5SMb9xSyCzn//gdokS0O3cJS2YWB65R\nDwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-08T11:40:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude"