hub.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ediakli448/Restyler-Claude/commits/758cdd5c72503befdaddad6b9eb09588bdb04538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T09:52:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T09:52:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Initial commit: Complete Veterinary Medicine Restyler architecture with Reference Engine\n\nFull-stack web application for restyling veterinary medicine lecture documents\ninto beautifully formatted RTL-aware HTML study guides using Claude Opus.\n\n- Backend: Express server with document parsing (PDF/DOCX), adaptive chunking,\n  style extraction from reference documents, LLM-based restyling with zero\n  information loss, image extraction/injection, and HTML assembly\n- Frontend: React 18 wizard UI with reference upload, document upload,\n  real-time WebSocket progress tracking, and preview/download\n- Infrastructure: Docker + docker-compose for containerized deployment\n- Rate-limit resilience with exponential backoff retry logic\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01VangytH8DhEu4NDFFJeduF","tree":{"sha":"cfcba3c5cc85b6a6060a6922591bf946dcad140d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ediakli448/Restyler-Claude/git/trees/cfcba3c5cc85b6a6060a6922591bf946dcad140d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ediakli448/Restyler-Claude/git/commits/758cdd5c72503befdaddad6b9eb09588bdb04538","verification":{"payload":"tree cfcba3c5cc85b6a6060a6922591bf946dcad140d\nparent 485ad8f1a9dc77cc61f93a6d06ca0bfcdbeffac0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772963570 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772963570 +0000\n\nInitial commit: Complete Veterinary Medicine Restyler architecture with Reference Engine\n\nFull-stack web application for restyling veterinary medicine lecture documents\ninto beautifully formatted RTL-aware HTML study guides using Claude Opus.\n\n- Backend: Express se