"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/189f7ebbf2ff561f04a72804633834f431240d77","node_id":"C_kwDORhfvT9oAKDE4OWY3ZWJiZjJmZjU2MWYwNGE3MjgwNDYzMzgzNGY0MzEyNDBkNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf","sha":"e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf"}],"sha":"189f7ebbf2ff561f04a72804633834f431240d77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/189f7ebbf2ff561f04a72804633834f431240d77"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-23T20:50:32Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-23T20:50:32Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"fix: nudge identity updates toward evolution over full rewrites\n\nTool description now asks LLM to read current identity first and evolve it\n(add, refine, deepen) rather than rewriting from scratch each time.\nFull rewrites still allowed — just flagged as rare. Aligns with BIBLE P1\n(\"Change means to supplement, clarify, reformulate, expand meaning\").","tree":{"sha":"8e5765b15bb0ca33f7b987d079bb9a15a9c4da2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/trees/8e5765b15bb0ca33f7b987d079bb9a15a9c4da2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/commits/e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf","node_id":"C_kwDORhfvT9oAKGU1ZDRhNzE3NzQ1OTM3ZmY1ZWI1NDY3OTRjYmFiYjU4Mjg0MDdkYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712","sha":"defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712"}],"sha":"e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/e5d4a717745937ff5eb546794cbabb5828407dbf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-23T20:43:34Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-23T20:43:34Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"v3.3.1: identity journal, change propagation checklist, gitignore safety net\n\nCherry-picked from ouroboros_mac v3.3.1 (source-only, no binary artifacts):\n- Identity journal: log diffs on every identity.md update (memory.py, control.py)\n- Change Propagation Checklist: 8-point mental checklist in SYSTEM.md (LLM-first)\n- server.py: apply GITHUB_REPO setting to git remote on startup and settings save\n\nNew fixes for dirty commits from bundled app:\n- .gitignore created BEFORE first git add -A in bootstrap_repo() and ensure_repo_present()\n- .gitignore added to Ouroboros.spec datas so it ships in PyInstaller bundle\n- copytree ignore patterns expanded: *.so, *.dylib, *.dll, *.dist-info, base_library.zip\n- repo_commit: _ensure_gitignore + _unstage_binaries safety net on git add -A","tree":{"sha":"d4211fb47eac0f30c8020281ded7c053ffa199ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/trees/d4211fb47eac0f30c8020281ded7c053ffa199ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/commits/defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712","node_id":"C_kwDORhfvT9oAKGRlZmIxNTU1Yzk5MDBiMmQ0Nzg3N2U0OThmZTM3MTg1ZWZkNDA3MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67","sha":"aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67"}],"sha":"defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/defb1555c9900b2d47877e498fe37185efd40712"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-23T18:41:56Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-23T18:41:56Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"v3.3.0: mutable identity doctrine, dual version header, cost accounting fix\n\n- Align identity policy across BIBLE/SYSTEM/README/ARCHITECTURE:\n  identity.md is a mutable manifesto (radical rewrites allowed),\n  physical file deletion stays prohibited, BIBLE.md remains\n  constitutionally non-deletable. Philosophy version 3.3.\n- Identity update cadence changed from ~4h to ~1h in SYSTEM.md.\n- Fix llm_usage cost accounting: fallback from usage.cost to evt.cost\n  so web_search (gpt-5.2) and claude_code_edit (Anthropic CLI) costs\n  are properly tracked.\n- Fix consciousness llm_usage events: add model and cost fields.\n- Fix pricing cache race in loop.py: single locked path.\n- Fix context pointer drift after compaction in loop.py.\n- Remove automatic budget footer from chat messages (dashboard only).\n- Dual version display in UI header: app X | rt Y.\n- Launcher passes OUROBOROS_APP_VERSION to server process.\n- /api/health returns runtime_version + app_version (backward compat).\n- Rewrite test_constitution.py for new doctrine.\n- Sync ARCHITECTURE.md API table (cost-breakdown, local-model endpoints).\n- Bump VERSION, pyproject.toml, README changelog to 3.3.0.","tree":{"sha":"219f6e34e1116a09f81909a7cb14f29ba9700a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/trees/219f6e34e1116a09f81909a7cb14f29ba9700a20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/commits/aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67","node_id":"C_kwDORhfvT9oAKGFmZjY5ZmRhNzMwYTY5OTcxYzA3MGE5NjRiNDZjYTJhZWI3MTZmNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/e3e5e613ef6cf69c77171109c337ee2b0e335efa","sha":"e3e5e613ef6cf69c77171109c337ee2b0e335efa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/e3e5e613ef6cf69c77171109c337ee2b0e335efa"}],"sha":"aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/aff69fda730a69971c070a964b46ca2aeb716f67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/e3e5e613ef6cf69c77171109c337ee2b0e335efa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-23T17:46:56Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-23T17:46:56Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"v3.2.0: fix stale drive_* refs, dead code, docs overhaul\n\nCode fixes:\n- loop.py: drive_read/drive_list → data_read/data_list in READ_ONLY_PARALLEL_TOOLS\n- context.py: drive_write → data_write in LARGE_CONTENT_TOOLS\n- app.js: remove dead window.showPage override (ES module scope issue)\n- consciousness.py: bound observation queue (maxsize=100)\n\nDocumentation:\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: fix empty section 3.5, add Costs page (3.6), renumber About (3.7)\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: delete ghost LOCAL_MODEL_ENABLED setting\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: add 10 missing settings to de