"message":"fix: use os._exit(42) + force-kill workers on restart\n\nsys.exit(42) was hanging because multiprocessing worker children\nprevented clean Python shutdown. Now: kill_workers(force=True) sends\nSIGKILL to all workers, then os._exit(42) hard-exits the process.\nAlso force-kill workers in shutdown_event handler.","tree":{"sha":"4d5190979f366ed27c5fade03f4fa874376b73d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/trees/4d5190979f366ed27c5fade03f4fa874376b73d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/commits/768775b7983a0481fc162d1c7a2357aa4b7184e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/768775b7983a0481fc162d1c7a2357aa4b7184e2","node_id":"C_kwDORhfvT9oAKDc2ODc3NWI3OTgzYTA0ODFmYzE2MmQxYzdhMjM1N2FhNGI3MTg0ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5","sha":"1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5"}],"sha":"768775b7983a0481fc162d1c7a2357aa4b7184e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/768775b7983a0481fc162d1c7a2357aa4b7184e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-22T00:00:12Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T00:00:12Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"fix: robust restart (port cleanup, poll port file) + rich log display\n\n- launcher.py: _kill_stale_on_port() kills leftover processes before start,\n  _poll_port_file() waits for fresh port file instead of premature read,\n  lifecycle loop deletes stale port file before each start, 2s delay after\n  exit for port release, kill stale on every restart/crash path\n- web/app.js: buildLogMessage() renders event fields by type (llm_round\n  shows model/tokens/cost, task_eval shows duration/tools, task_received\n  shows message text, etc.) instead of only showing task_id","tree":{"sha":"0566b18b381178ce94286f8b2940360d0af7022a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/trees/0566b18b381178ce94286f8b2940360d0af7022a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/commits/1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5","node_id":"C_kwDORhfvT9oAKDFiYmJlNjEzYTE3NTQ1MzM2MWNjNTVjYmQ1ZWZkZmMyNDlkMGU3YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexSkvor/mobius/commit/f4f3baab08b7d77d14f76eddfb38cc6487493704","sha":"f4f3baab08b7d77d14f76eddfb38cc6487493704","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/f4f3baab08b7d77d14f76eddfb38cc6487493704"}],"sha":"1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/1bbbe613a175453361cc55cbd5efdfc249d0e7b5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/commits/f4f3baab08b7d77d14f76eddfb38cc6487493704/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:50:21Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:50:21Z","email":"anton@MacBook-Air-6.local","name":"Anton"},"message":"bump: v8.0.0 — launcher/server architecture, three-tier safety, web UI","tree":{"sha":"480ef2ff369ecf80fd748f3c14f3701f460ad8c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/trees/480ef2ff369ecf80fd748f3c14f3701f460ad8c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexSkvor/mobius/git/commits/f4f3baab08b7d77d14f76eddfb38cc6487493704","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"