- Popup: tick stats, option toggles, flash-duration slider, sortable\n  component table (renders, wasted, rate, peak, source)\n- Copy component source path via class debug info or page source maps\n- JSON/CSV export (CSV formula-injection guarded)\n- Full-page report reader: live-tab polling, file upload, summary\n  cards, top-15 bars, searchable/sortable table\n- SW-restart resilience via chrome.storage.session rehydration\n\nAlso add shared shield/render-pulse logo (svg + png) to the\nangular-scan library and surface it in its README.","tree":{"sha":"2dc5875340c88e268309869a19b66855c4c0920a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/git/trees/2dc5875340c88e268309869a19b66855c4c0920a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/git/commits/e431bc64906e897a851e2328ccd36a34d1833623","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dc5875340c88e268309869a19b66855c4c0920a\nparent 93614d128bcc931a3e1dcb423b4c60abc04689b8\nauthor Hussein AbdElaziz <hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee> 1780706966 +0300\ncommitter Hussein AbdElaziz <hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee> 1780706966 +0300\n\nfeat: add angular-scan browser extension and library logo\n\nAdd a Chrome/Edge MV3 extension that activates angular-scan on any\nAngular dev-mode page without modifying the host app. Its main-world\nscript reimplements the scanner core against window.ng.* so it runs\nstandalone — no host changes, no lib bundle.\n\nExtension features:\n- Angular dev-mode detection via window.ng.ɵsetProfiler; per-origin\n  enable/disable persisted in chrome.storage.sync\n- Toolbar badge: blank / PROD / OFF / ON / red wasted-render count\n- Canvas overlay: yellow=render, red=wasted, with fade; scroll-pinned\n  render-count badges; top-layer Popover re-assert over app dialogs\n- Popup: tick stats, option toggles, flash-duration slider, sortable\n  component table (renders, wasted, rate, peak, source)\n- Copy component source path via class debug info or page source maps\n- JSON/CSV export (CSV formula-injection guarded)\n- Full-page report reader: live-tab polling, file upload, summary\n  cards, top-15 bars, searchable/sortable table\n- SW-restart resilience via chrome.storage.session rehydration\n\nAlso add shared shield/render-pulse logo (svg + png) to the\nangular-scan library and surface it in its README.\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRwIiu+8QdecEZJgw33sba/OSpWNgUCaiNulhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ97G2vzkqVjZidQD+MDpJnkRISV9eHsF5j6TQ\nmwqJoROVzIGQ4Pb6+aZAzXkBALXOhcEuggH0gEMWGH4AlNTes/JYKwklZJZX+pgR\nf7YP\n=neV/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commit/e431bc64906e897a851e2328ccd36a34d1833623","node_id":"C_kwDORhtJAtoAKGU0MzFiYzY0OTA2ZTg5N2E4NTFlMjMyOGNjZDM2YTM0ZDE4MzM2MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commit/93614d128bcc931a3e1dcb423b4c60abc04689b8","sha":"93614d128bcc931a3e1dcb423b4c60abc04689b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commits/93614d128bcc931a3e1dcb423b4c60abc04689b8"}],"sha":"e431bc64906e897a851e2328ccd36a34d1833623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commits/e431bc64906e897a851e2328ccd36a34d1833623"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commits/93614d128bcc931a3e1dcb423b4c60abc04689b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T17:12:25Z","email":"hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee","name":"Hussein AbdElaziz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T17:12:25Z","email":"hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee","name":"Hussein AbdElaziz"},"message":"chore: release version 1.1.0","tree":{"sha":"4a24f822810b52e16f1d4594c3c86e3b77933ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/git/trees/4a24f822810b52e16f1d4594c3c86e3b77933ece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/git/c