ad09390e9e5593fa2ebdf42e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commits/28265a1726821daad09390e9e5593fa2ebdf42e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/commits/d381a13fe130b1811ce4a298233ed5b55614c90a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T16:34:30Z","email":"hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee","name":"Hussein AbdElaziz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T16:34:30Z","email":"hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee","name":"Hussein AbdElaziz"},"message":"feat: enhance toolbar functionality and styling\n\n- Updated the `ScannerService` to improve toolbar instance management by adding a host element parameter.\n- Modified the `AngularScanOptions` interface to clarify the default behavior of the scanning feature.\n- Refactored the `OverlayService` initialization logic to simplify conditions.\n- Introduced a new `ToolbarSettingToggleComponent` for better handling of toolbar settings.\n- Enhanced the `ToolbarComponent` to utilize the new toggle component and improved event handling for user interactions.\n- Added styles for the toolbar settings and improved overall UI responsiveness.\n- Implemented utility functions for managing floating panel behavior and clamping to viewport.\n- Added unit tests for new functionalities and ensured existing tests are updated accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"bbab149e3321055451253a97040f9ec30b03746e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/git/trees/bbab149e3321055451253a97040f9ec30b03746e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/husseinAbdElaziz/angular-scan/git/commits/d381a13fe130b1811ce4a298233ed5b55614c90a","verification":{"payload":"tree bbab149e3321055451253a97040f9ec30b03746e\nparent 2acc96b4f0a59958595d9158ea38de2fc4d95131\nauthor Hussein AbdElaziz <hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee> 1779726870 +0300\ncommitter Hussein AbdElaziz <hussein.abdelaziz@bwt.ee> 1779726870 +0300\n\nfeat: enhance toolbar functionality and styling\n\n- Updated the 