squire4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jsquire4","id":17258143,"login":"jsquire4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjU4MTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsquire4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsquire4/commit-tracker/commits/50dc9d65927b8db4b6024e170a948028b893915b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T20:37:48Z","email":"jacobmsquire@gmail.com","name":"jsquire4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T20:37:48Z","email":"jacobmsquire@gmail.com","name":"jsquire4"},"message":"Merge feature/global-date-range-selector into main\n\nGlobal date range selector — full backend + frontend implementation.\n\nBackend: TimeScope parameter object replaces int weekCount across 20+\nmethods in AnalyticsService, DisplacementService, ExecutiveHealthComposer,\nDriftDetectionService, PortfolioService, BriefingService, IcInsightsService.\n14 controller endpoints accept dateFrom/dateTo alongside weekCount.\n\nFrontend: WeekRangeSelector in global nav bar with From/To dropdowns,\nquick presets (4w/Qtr/YTD), DraftDisclaimer banner, 150ms fade transitions.\nAll 6 views wired to global Zustand filters. Old per-page date selectors\nremoved. Net -131 lines of duplicated date management code.\n\nAudit: 2 high (hooks violations), 20 medium (stale Javadoc, FQN imports),\n5 low findings — all fixed. Re-audit clean.\n\nQA: Deployed to Railway, browser-tested. Fixed PostgreSQL 503 on nullable\ndate params in CycleRepository native query.\n\nCo-Authored-