"xiexing1001@gmail.com","name":"Xircth"},"message":"fix(plugins): read live MCP tools for status\n\nThe MCP popover still hid Open Connector tools because status used\nthe imported package snapshot, which predated the declared tool list.\n\nRe-inspect the plugin source when building the status report so\nworkerHttp tools come from the current MCP resource.","tree":{"sha":"bd995c77b3d6acb32264ec6840636b74ea572f29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xircth/VibeX/git/trees/bd995c77b3d6acb32264ec6840636b74ea572f29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xircth/VibeX/git/commits/44688a30e1cb577993e7c32cc258aabdf3bbc193","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145731012?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Xircth","id":145731012,"login":"Xircth","node_id":"U_kgDOCK-txA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xircth","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xircth/VibeX/commit/44688a30e1cb577993e7c32cc258aabdf3bbc193","node_id":"C_kwDORh5rftoAKDQ0Njg4YTMwZTFjYjU3Nzk5M2U3YzMyY2MyNThhYWJkZjNiYmMxOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xircth/VibeX/commit/99474a908ee02830c5db37c48047b9a49201af5e","sha":"99474a908ee02830c5db37c48047b9a49201af5e","url":"https://api.github.c