ments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/08ee18d51d1fba081d2ffcbefcb8220bb6e2d641/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T00:19:25Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T00:19:25Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"feat(hooks): atomic per-skill claim dedup, fix race condition and UserPromptSubmit sharing; bump to 0.6.0\n\nParallel PreToolUse hooks were racing on the same seen-skills file, causing 2-6x\nduplicate injections. UserPromptSubmit hook didn''t share dedup state at all.\n\nFix by implementing atomic per-skill claim files (Oracle session: fix-dedup-race-condition-plan):\n\n1. In hooks/src/hook-env.mts, add tryClaimSessionKey(sessionId, kind, key) using\n   openSync(path, ''wx'') for atomic exclusive create. Add listSessionKeys() to read\n   claim dir, syncSessionFileFromClaims() to derive the txt snapshot, and\n   removeSessionClaimDir() for cleanup. Claim files live in\n   <tmpdir>/vercel-plugin-<sessionId>-seen-skills.d/<skill-name>.\n\n2. In hooks/src/patterns.mts, add mergeSeenSkillStates(...values) to union env var,\n   session file, and claim dir state. Add serializeSeenSkills(set) helper.\n\n3. In hooks/src/pretooluse-skill-inject.mts, load merged state from env+file+claims.\n   Before injecting each skill, call tryClaimSessionKey — first process wins, others\n   get EEXIST and skip. Use same claim path for once-only keys (agent-browser warning,\n   vercel-env-help). Pass sessionId through InjectOptions.\n\n4. In hooks/src/user-prompt-submit-skill-inject.mts, preserve sessionId from parsed\n   input, load merged seen state, pass sessionId to injection flow so it uses the\n   shared claim backend. Skills injected via promptSignals now visible to PreToolUse.\n\n5. In hooks/src/session-end-cleanup.mts, add rmSync deletion of claim directories.\n\n6. Update CLAUDE.md dedup contract to document atomic claim mechanism.\n7. Bump .plugin/plugin.json to 0.6.0, rebuild.","tree":{"sha":"e478dad43fd7c3e4f76b3fb8ad2113f89990a73c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/e478dad43fd7c3e4f76b3fb8ad2113f89990a73c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/08ee18d51d1fba081d2ffcbefcb8220bb6e2d641","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/08ee18d51d1fba081d2ffcbefcb8220bb6e2d641","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKDA4ZWUxOGQ1MWQxZmJhMDgxZDJmZmNiZWZjYjgyMjBiYjZlMmQ2NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b","sha":"aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b"}],"sha":"08ee18d51d1fba081d2ffcbefcb8220bb6e2d641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/08ee18d51d1fba081d2ffcbefcb8220bb6e2d641"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T00:17:53Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T00:17:53Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"fix(user-prompt-hook): share seen-skill dedup state with session claims\n\nUserPromptSubmit previously deduped only against VERCEL_PLUGIN_SEEN_SKILLS,\nso prompt-signal injections were invisible to PreToolUse when session-file/claim\nstate diverged. This caused duplicate skill injection across hooks.\n\nThis change merges seen-skill state from env + session file + atomic claim keys,\npasses sessionId through injectSkills, and syncs injected skills back into claim\nstate after injection so both hooks observe one dedup source of truth.\n\nVerified: bun test hooks/user-prompt-submit-skill-inject.test.ts (2 pass)\nVerified: bun run build:hooks (pass)\nSwarm-Agent: codex-userprompt-dedup","tree":{"sha":"2f6761c2b81e42b56687b6e666a465a178f66792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/2f6761c2b81e42b56687b6e666a465a178f66792"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKGFhZDllMTFkYmUyYTkxZGU0ODU3ZmI2MDZhZjg3Y2IyMDFmN2Y0NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/62f1fb2d7cee3e67fbf19f6fb78831607ffa38ab","sha":"62f1fb2d7cee3e67fbf19f6fb78831607ffa38ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/62f1fb2d7cee3e67fbf19f6fb78831607ffa38ab"}],"sha":"aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/aad9e11dbe2a91de4857fb606af87cb201f7f45b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/62f1fb2d7cee3e67fbf19f6fb78831607ffa38ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T00:14:29Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T00:14:29Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"fix(hooks): use atomic seen-skill claims in pretool hook\n\nPreToolUse dedup now merges env, legacy file, and per-key claim state so\nparallel hooks converge on one seen-skills view.\n\nSkill injection now performs per-skill atomic claims before appending content,\nskipping skills already claimed by concurrent hooks and syncing env/file from\nclaim keys. Once-only warning/help keys now use the same claim path when a\nsession id is available, with previous in-process append fallback preserved\nwhen no session id exists.\n\nVerified: bun run build:hooks\nVerified: bun test tests/pretooluse-skill-inject.test.ts\nSwarm-Agent: codex-pretool-claims","tree":{"sha":"50407b604b94fc32949600097e68361d0d0d8ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/50407b604b94fc32949600097e68361d0d0d8ca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/62f1fb2d7cee3e67fbf19f6fb78831607ffa38ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/62f1fb2d7cee3e67fbf19f6fb78831607ffa38ab","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKDYyZjFmYjJkN2NlZTNlNjdmYmYxOWY2ZmI3ODgzMTYwN2ZmYTM4YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/847f368f6bb76ba64a99fdd15eeebb067780b94a","sha":"847f368f6bb76ba64a99fdd15eeebb067780b94a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/847f368f6bb76ba64a99fdd15eeebb