wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/cbf4ed8a3ed0190f6e17b3bf2e408bc837000fce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T21:39:08Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T21:39:08Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"revert(hooks): remove temp file dedup, restore pure env-var dedup via CLAUDE_ENV_FILE; bump to 0.5.5\n\nThe 0.5.4 release added session-scoped temp files for dedup persistence, but this\nwas wrong — CLAUDE_ENV_FILE env vars ARE propagated to hook subprocesses by Claude\nCode. The temp file approach littered tmpdir with hundreds of small files.\n\nRevert to the original env-var-only mechanism:\n\n1. Remove readSessionFile/writeSessionFile/dedupFilePath from hooks/src/hook-env.mts\n2. Remove all writeSessionFile calls from pretooluse-skill-inject.mts — revert to\n   pure process.env.VERCEL_PLUGIN_SEEN_SKILLS = appendSeenSkill(...) pattern\n3. Remove sessionId from InjectOptions and the injectSkills call site\n4. Remove sessionId from posttooluse-validate.mts ParsedInput — revert\n   isAlreadyValidated/markValidated to pure env-var signatures\n5. Revert all test expectations back to \"env-var\" and \"memory-only\" strategies\n6. Restore CLAUDE.md dedup contract to env-var-only documentation","tree":{"sha":"7e433a2ce5ec7cb939a39d7ab5dda1306957c537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/7e433a2ce5ec7cb939a39d7ab5dda1306957c537"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/cbf4ed8a3ed0190f6e17b3bf2e408bc837000fce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/cbf4ed8a3ed0190f6e17b3bf2e408bc837000fce","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKGNiZjRlZDhhM2VkMDE5MGY2ZTE3YjNiZjJlNDA4YmM4MzcwMDBmY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/c107aec73dc2539b5a16d30e32b2cba9cf62d055","sha":"c107aec73dc2539b5a16d30e32b2cba9cf62d055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/c107aec73dc2539b5a16d30e32b2cba9cf62d055"}],"sha":"cbf4ed8a3ed0190f6e17b3bf2e408bc837000fce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/cbf4ed8a3ed0190f6e17b3bf2e408bc837000fce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/c107aec73dc2539b5a16d30e32b2cba9cf62d055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T21:22:35Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T21:23:09Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"fix(hooks): persist skill dedup across hook invocations via session-scoped temp files; bump to 0.5.4\n\nSkill dedup is completely broken because CLAUDE_ENV_FILE vars are only available to Bash\ntool commands, not hook subprocesses. Each PreToolUse invocation starts a fresh Node.js\nprocess that never sees VERCEL_PLUGIN_SEEN_SKILLS.\n\nTo fix this:\n\n1. In hooks/src/hook-env.mts, add readSessionFile(sessionId, kind) and\n   writeSessionFile(sessionId, kind, value) helpers that read/write\n   /tmp/vercel-plugin-<sessionId>-<kind>.txt for persistent dedup state.\n\n2. In hooks/src/pretooluse-skill-inject.mts, read seen skills from the session file\n   at startup using readSessionFile(sessionId, \"seen-skills\"). Add a persistSeen()\n   closure inside injectSkills() that calls both appendSeenSkill and writeSessionFile.\n   Replace all process.env.VERCEL_PLUGIN_SEEN_SKILLS = appendSeenSkill(...) calls with\n   persistSeen() or inline writeSessionFile calls. Add \"file\" as the primary dedup\n   strategy when session_id is present, falling back to \"env-var\" then \"memory-only\".\n   Pass sessionId through InjectOptions to injectSkills().\n\n3. In hooks/src/posttooluse-validate.mts, add sessionId to ParsedInput and extract it\n   from input.session_id in parseInput(). Pass sessionId to isAlreadyValidated() and\n   markValidated(), which should read/write via readSessionFile/writeSessionFile for\n   the \"validated-files\" kind.\n\n4. Update tests: pretooluse-skill-inject.test.ts — rename \"no env var\" test to expect\n   file-based dedup persistence, update strategy assertions from \"env-var\" to \"file\",\n   use omitSessionId for memory-only test. subagent-fresh-env.test.ts — use a fresh\n   session ID for subagent calls, update strategy expectations to \"file\".\n   session-timeline-subagent.test.ts — add sessionId option to runHookEnv, use a\n   different session ID for the subagent call.\n\n5. Update CLAUDE.md dedup contract section to document file-based mechanism.\n\n6. Bump .plugin/plugin.json version to 0.5.4, run bun run build.","tree":{"sha":"a9708712375f23f9ce744595ad5ade53f135ec99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/a9708712375f23f9ce744595ad5ade53f135ec99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/c107aec73dc2539b5a16d30e32b2cba9cf62d055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","