d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/242d69f686b86ae2607327dfad2a2c6b5b1c369b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T13:00:57Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T13:01:17Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"Extract the match/rank engine from pretooluse-skill-inject.mjs into patterns.mjs so it can be shared between the PreToolUse hook and a new CLI explain command. Add compileSkillPatterns() and rankMatches() to patterns.mjs. Refactor pretooluse-skill-inject.mjs to import and use the shared engine instead of inline matching logic.\n\nCreate hooks/vercel-config.mjs that reads vercel.json and maps top-level keys (rewrites, redirects, headers, crons, functions) to skill slugs, so skills are injected when the project uses those Vercel features.\n\nCreate hooks/logger.mjs with structured logging at four levels (off, summary, debug, trace) controlled by VERCEL_PLUGIN_LOG_LEVEL env var. Support legacy VERCEL_PLUGIN_DEBUG=1 mapping to debug level.\n\nCreate src/cli/explain.ts that takes a tool name and input JSON, runs the match engine, and prints which skills would fire and why. Create src/cli/index.ts as the CLI entry point. Create src/commands/doctor.ts for diagnosing plugin setup issues.\n\nCreate src/shared/logger.ts and src/shared/match-engine.ts as TypeScript versions of the shared utilities.\n\nCreate scripts/build-manifest.ts that reads all SKILL.md files, parses frontmatter, and generates generated/skill-manifest.json.\n\nAdd CLAUDE.md documenting the architecture, dedup contract, YAML parser quirks, test conventions, and log levels.\n\nAdd tests: tests/cli-explain.test.ts, tests/logger.test.ts, tests/vercel-config.test.ts, tests/snapshot-runner.test.ts with snapshot files in tests/snapshots/. Add test fixtures in tests/fixtures/. Update existing tests to copy new hook modules (logger.mjs, vercel-config.mjs) into temp dirs.\n\nUpdate package.json with new bin entry and dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"2af40bfa746724e8941005b5f7230fb35c3de082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/2af40bfa746724e8941005b5f7230fb35c3de082"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/242d69f686b86ae2607327dfad2a2c6b5b1c369b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/242d69f686b86ae2607327dfad2a2c6b5b1c369b","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKDI0MmQ2OWY2ODZiODZhZTI2MDczMjdkZmFkMmEyYzZiNWIxYzM2OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5","sha":"29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5"}],"sha":"242d69f686b86ae2607327dfad2a2c6b5b1c369b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/242d69f686b86ae2607327dfad2a2c6b5b1c369b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T05:13:55Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T05:13:55Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"fix(hooks): switch dedup from temp file to env var\n\nThe seen-skills dedup was using a temp file written via SessionStart,\nbut PreToolUse hooks can''t update CLAUDE_ENV_FILE. This caused errors\nwhen the temp file became stale or inaccessible across session clears.\n\nNow VERCEL_PLUGIN_SEEN_SKILLS is a comma-delimited string stored\ndirectly in the session environment. SessionStart initializes it as\nempty, and the PreToolUse hook reads/updates process.env in-place.","tree":{"sha":"229e02fcba56667d7a2fbf7bd4cc10877b1caee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/229e02fcba56667d7a2fbf7bd4cc10877b1caee2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKDI5YjA3MzczNzZlMzg1Zjc0ZDQxOWY3NzNiMDQ3NjljNzZjNmY5YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca","sha":"0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca"}],"sha":"29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/29b0737376e385f74d419f773b04769c76c6f9c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T04:29:34Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T04:29:34Z","email":"johnlindquist@gmail.com","name":"John Lindquist"},"message":"fix(hooks): replace js-yaml with inline frontmatter parser\n\nRemove the external js-yaml dependency from skill frontmatter parsing and\nimplement an inline YAML subset parser in hooks/skill-map-frontmatter.mjs.\n\nThe new parser handles key/value pairs, nested objects by indentation,\nblock lists, inline arrays, number scalars, quoted strings, and strict\nyaml-structure errors with readable Invalid YAML frontmatter messages.\n\nVerified: bun test tests/skill-map-frontmatter.test.ts --test-name-pattern ''^extractFrontmatter'' (7 passed)\nVerified: bun test tests/skill-map-frontmatter.test.ts --test-name-pattern ''^parseSkillFrontmatter'' (6 passed)\nVerified: bun test tests/skill-map-frontmatter.test.ts --test-name-pattern ''scans actual skills directory and finds all skills'' (1 passed)\nVerified: bun test tests/skill-map-frontmatter.test.ts --test-name-pattern ''no warnings emitted for well-formed skills directory'' (1 passed)\nVerified: bun -e \"import { buildSkillMap } from ''./hooks/skill-map-frontmatter.mjs''; const map = buildSkillMap(''./skills''); console.log(JSON.stringify({skillCount:Object.keys(map.skills).length, diagnostics:map.diagnostics.length, warnings:map.warnings.length}, null, 2));\" (skillCount=28 diagnostics=0 warnings=0)\nVerified: bun -e \"import { parseSkillFrontmatter } from ''./hooks/skill-map-frontmatter.mjs''; const yaml = ''name: demo\\ndescription: one:two\\nmetadata:\\n  priority: 7\\n  filePattern: [\\''app/**\\'', \\''src/**\\'']\\n  bashPattern:\\n    - \\''\\\\bnpm\\\\s+run\\\\b\\''\\n    -\\n      nested: value\\n''; const parsed = parseSkillFrontmatter(yaml); if (parsed.name !== ''demo'') throw new Error(''name mismatch''); if (parsed.description !== ''one:two'') throw new Error(''description mismatch''); if (parsed.metadata.priority !== 7) throw new Error(''priority mismatch''); if (!Array.isArray(parsed.metadata.filePattern) || parsed.metadata.filePattern.length !== 2) throw new Error(''filePattern mismatch''); if (parsed.metadata.bashPattern[0] !== ''\\\\bnpm\\\\s+run\\\\b'') throw new Error(''bashPattern mismatch''); if (parsed.metadata.bashPattern[1]?.nested !== ''value'') throw new Error(''nested list object mismatch'');\" (pass)\nSwarm-Agent: inline-yaml-frontmatter-parser","tree":{"sha":"3aa9b76c8f981ecde14f9396c33e47793f5b265d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/3aa9b76c8f981ecde14f9396c33e47793f5b265d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca","node_id":"C_kwDORh6aR9oAKDBmOWEzNmYzOTI4NjQzMTJmMzlkNzA0NGY5NWQ4YTk0MDA4MGNkY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commit/f0a1a52cd41e52561276e22f303b593419185dd2","sha":"f0a1a52cd41e52561276e22f303b593419185dd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/f0a1a52cd41e52561276e22f303b593419185dd2"}],"sha":"0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/commits/0f9a36f392864312f39d7044f95d8a940080cdca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?