ocument that --src-dir requires src/proxy.ts not root\n- @ai-sdk/react: document as required separate install for useChat hooks\n- maxSteps removal: replace with stopWhen/stepCountIs across all docs\n- toDataStreamResponse: fix remaining v5 references to toUIMessageStreamResponse\n- Neon lazy init: add build-time safe pattern (neon() crashes without DATABASE_URL)\n- drizzle-kit: document that it doesn''t auto-load .env.local\n- Marketplace CLI: document AI agent term-acceptance blocker\n- Clerk: add org flow gotchas (redirect loop, missing env vars, proxy location)","tree":{"sha":"5a132625aee31c2984697262df9072a3e19bf92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/trees/5a132625aee31c2984697262df9072a3e19bf92c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamSammane/vercel-plugin/git/commits/5b43dbe07f856fd84c4586eafabec589eabedeb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnlindquist","id":36073,"login":"johnlindquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnlindquist","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SamSamma