e)\n- Add remoteEntry.js existence check in merge-dist.js so a missing\n  Angular build artifact fails loudly instead of silently copying nothing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: Refactor Angular Module\n\n* docs: Updated Readme\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90c9b7352c11ec6190bdb665660b2e598cf7afc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kasun002/micro-fe/git/trees/90c9b7352c11ec6190bdb665660b2e598cf7afc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kasun002/micro-fe/git/commits/00eb17c1c709b79c152344032377751abb449561","verification":{"payload":"tree 90c9b7352c11ec6190bdb665660b2e598cf7afc2\nparent cede1c8a46b9ec93971a1b912b10b22b67eb385b\nauthor Kasun Abaywardana <abaywardanakasun@gmail.com> 1774343083 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774343083 +0800\n\nFix deployment and Vercel issues, update Angular configurations (#6)\n\n* fix: Fixed Vercal issue\n\n* fix: Fixed Readme\n\n* fix: Fixed Deployment issue\n\n* fix: Vercle config updated\n\n* feat: Link Angular mf in to System\n\n* fix: Fix Deployment Issue\n\n* fix: webpack config to COmpile issue on angular COmponent\n\n* fix: Updated package json\n\n* fix: Updated Web Pack relevant packages\n\n* fix: Updated Index file\n\n* fix: FIx Angular Loading Issue in shell\n\n* fix: pin mf-angular dist output path and add remoteEntry guard\n\n- Add explicit output.path in mf-angular/webpack.config.js using\n  path.resolve(__dirname, ''dist'') so webpack always writes to the\n  correct directory regardless of CWD (fixes Vercel npm --prefix issue)\n- Add remoteEntry.js existence check in merge-dist.js so a missing\n  Angular build artifact fails loudly instead of silently copying nothing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: Refactor Angular Module\n\n* docs: Updated Readme\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----B