,"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T08:51:49Z","email":"abaywardanakasun@gmail.com","name":"Kasun Abaywardana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T08:51:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix deployment and Vercel issues, update README and config (#4)\n\n* fix: Fixed Vercal issue\n\n* fix: Fixed Readme\n\n* fix: Fixed Deployment issue\n\n* fix: Vercle config updated\n\n* feat: Link Angular mf in to System\n\n* fix: Fix Deployment Issue\n\n* fix: webpack config to COmpile issue on angular COmponent\n\n* fix: Updated package json\n\n* fix: Updated Web Pack relevant packages\n\n* fix: Updated Index file\n\n* fix: FIx Angular Loading Issue in shell\n\n* fix: pin mf-angular dist output path and add remoteEntry guard\n\n- Add explicit output.path in mf-angular/webpack.config.js using\n  path.resolve(__dirname, ''dist'') so webpack always writes to the\n  correct directory regardless of CWD (fixes Vercel npm --prefix issue)\n- Add remoteEntry.js existence check in merge-dist.js so a missing\n  Angular build artifact fails loudly instead of silently copying nothing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e8c146483a89b03bd95b1dedcffd3eed004e783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kasun002/micro-fe/git/trees/2e8c146483a89b03bd95b1dedcffd3eed004e783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kasun002/micro-fe/git/commits/701638b70b0c7078c09d132ebe14c4e306f4fbd9","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e8c146483a89b03bd95b1dedcffd3eed004e783\nparent 877fc36303da09beeecea24d97cb5ea1e041e592\nauthor Kasun Abaywardana <abaywardanakasun@gmail.com> 1774342309 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774342309 +0800\n\nFix deployment and Vercel issues, update README and config (#4)\n\n* fix: Fixed Vercal issue\n\n* fix: Fixed Readme\n\n* fix: Fixed Deployment issue\n\n* fix: Vercle config updated\n\n* feat: Link Angular mf in to Syste