"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:45:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mods): image viewer sends image bytes inline so Warp draws them (0.3.0) (#83)\n\nThe viewer handed the terminal a file path to open. Warp (0.2026.09.30)\ndraws kitty-protocol images sent as inline bytes and ignores a path: a script\noutside Claude Code showed the inline form drawing and the path form blank.\nThe mod now reads the saved PNG and sends its bytes.\n\n- An image over 2 MiB cannot go inline and is captioned with its size.\n- A draft''s image is not on disk until the prompt is submitted, so the row\n  no longer says \"not found on disk\" for one that has not been sent.\n- Keeps the 0.2.0 layout changes (one image on a narrow band, the band''s\n  row limit).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae05ebfed89093ffc393dce4691177d3a914306f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/ae05ebfed89093ffc393dce4691177d3a914306f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/dee5c794eda954f5360d490a5283c9a73d9df672","verification":{"payload":"tree ae05ebfed89093ffc393dce4691177d3a914306f\nparent a72c027daf371ab640206e5851ab5a75619e1a39\nauthor Rashad Cureton <rashad.cureton@gmail.com> 1791409509 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791409509 -0400\n\nfix(mods): image viewer sends image bytes inline so Warp draws them (0.3.0) (#83)\n\nThe viewer handed the terminal a file path to open. Warp (0.2026.09.30)\ndraws kitty-protocol images sent as inline bytes and ignores a path: a script\noutside Claude Code showed the inline form drawing and the path form blank.\nThe mod now reads the saved PNG and sends its bytes.\n\n- An image over 2 MiB cannot go inline and is captioned with its size.\n- A draft''s image is not on disk until the prompt is submitted, so the row\n  no longer says \"not found on disk\" for one that has not been sent.\n- Keeps the 0.2.0 layout changes (one image on a narrow band, the band''s\n  row limit).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxr1lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQdcQAIxaPPnMRtC6J/4PFMPK2E2I\nH7sH98Hmg0WJdLgHFQ0r9TnxRtQjXobFgTrFDWPFpOa2Y9jdn8cOpG2pEgqMVz7m\nKUbNG14lva12CpEcKZ+Ck/aRuMIkH5XNQBu4zRgNFFqjdCMK/YOmdij/wxoSszV/\nKscFqOiR1PADZT//dU92hZZLjdAz0BwKnr+Vlh9Rkwi4vUOhCEAhm7AGNzTQlTNd\nQXiPFS6z5fOPeuL3XfViZ55x9yoF12ymCOf0RLW+nB0hW3+H7n53qpKuSMfClxa+\nZz4bOJVsLmJ99QjVrT7xuK5BfsdoJAyI5J8y5d/6HZ8CSzOOJ9ZwweDjmUL6w7HZ\nUJQ+Wsr5Aniw+vxWhAEN2r2OLpCSskf7MTM7VGn+l6qSwycic1AFnR9YA3i0+2vl\nVr9+WL7KnYBfvC/KqZjH69qTa6/eru/scuxVCicywbGby2xqlmBtrk1aTz+Hfs0d\nzukN+OzPsGMk49Gw0bOGQ7x2LsVlfkdu1MVyIqza+ZMQrMM/OHJYsHZWjMJ9CjQT\nzuzi1XxxW4A2KdpSB7XBLmvUR0lcOywMYHPuDkWxrToI1gl1zXty7lVpmjM6Q/cd\n52qSg0ud/SiyrohqP92lvakSN1qpYex5KzX+Sf9ojzk5CPvV1g1udBQIMr+aueCB\n3U5CZ1r/wnxcm81vCWGt\n=nKoK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T21:45:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web