t: removed all 14 carried-over `effort: high` pins. Opus 5.5 defaults to\n  medium (~Opus 5 high); a seeded-reviewer sweep showed 5/5 recall at both\n  levels with equal cost and time. CLAUDE.md/AUTHORING rule: pin only with an\n  eval showing the gain.\n- Untrusted input guardrail in 9 skills/agents that read third-party material\n  (solicitations, RFPs, contracts, web pages, client docs, code under review).\n- Frontend: the guide''s named fallback styles added to design-studio''s\n  anti-pattern list and web-design-expert.\n- parallel-agent-orchestration: time-budget signals for lead agents.\n- security-review trigger leads with \"Security review\" (didn''t fire in sweep).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2efd741497c3497463962b7061530fe721da16d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/2efd741497c3497463962b7061530fe721da16d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/6b5e3ac094d13b88d00129602ceec096ae98dbf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commit/6b5e3ac094d13b88d00129602ceec096ae98dbf2","node_id":"C_kwDORh8o4doAKDZiNWUzYWMwOTRkMTNiODhkMDAxMjk2MDJjZWVjMDk2YWU5OGRiZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commit/fa51d9ebbf8507c2125b85366ae99ddf97162452","sha":"fa51d9ebbf8507c2125b85366ae99ddf97162452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/fa51d9ebbf8507c2125b85366ae99ddf97162452"}],"sha":"6b5e3ac094d13b88d00129602ceec096ae98dbf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/6b5e3ac094d13b88d00129602ceec096ae98dbf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v