ions in 69 skills -> plain `cmd` \"run these first\" bullets\n  (degrades gracefully; the 7 skills pre-approving Bash keep injection)\n- audit CRIT: injection without Bash in allowed-tools (+ self-test; fires on\n  exactly the 69 pre-fix skills)\n- AUTHORING §2 / CLAUDE.md doctrine; BACKLOG voids the sweep''s Δ=0 reading\n- postmortem: docs/postmortems/2026-09-23-silent-no-op-harness-integration.md\n\nVerified: market-research 0.00 -> 1.00, dora-metrics loads (no denial).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8d570a38dfafde83132fc5d004ff97d96a99beb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/c8d570a38dfafde83132fc5d004ff97d96a99beb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/761eef14daa52e676e2f3eae12eb15658ab56ce0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commit/761eef14daa52e676e2f3eae12eb15658ab56ce0","node_id":"C_kwDORh8o4doAKDc2MWVlZjE0ZGFhNTJlNjc2ZTJmM2VhZTEyZWIxNTY1OGFiNTZjZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commit/30fe2296ef0d22054e81b5b4f7f5b49e0357dd6d","sha":"30fe2296ef0d22054e81b5b4f7f5b49e0357dd6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/30fe2296ef0d22054e81b5b4f7f5b49e0357dd6d"}],"sha":"761eef14daa52e676e2f3eae12eb15658ab56ce0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/761eef14daa52e676e2f3eae12eb15658ab56ce0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/o