"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/672d4d68003b52ebb9561fd082783175e7118de1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:06:01Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:06:01Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"message":"fix: Wave 5 T52 — revive dead hook guards, correct verified factual defects, new audit lints\n\nHooks (security): five plugin hooks read a nonexistent CLAUDE_TOOL_INPUT env var\nand silently no-op''d since v3 — the .env/lockfile/credential edit guard, the\nskill-content security guard, the dangerous-Bash guard, the prompt warning, and\nskill telemetry (usage-report showed 0/103 skills used in 90 days). Hook input is\nJSON on stdin under tool_input. Logic moved to hooks/cure_guard.py (fail-open,\nstdlib) with a 28-case regression matrix in CI; patterns tightened so the revived\nguards don''t block .env.example, secrets-manager.ts, or rm -rf ./build. Same bug\nfixed in the bootstrap hook template.\n\nFacts (each verified against a primary source): 2026 §199A threshold (single\n\\$201,750; MFS figure had been used) in irc-lookup and the CPA benchmark key;\nqsbs-compliance updated for OBBBA two-regime §1202 and correct §1045; §174A\nsmall-business retroactive