ureton@gmail.com","name":"rcureton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:31:15Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"rcureton"},"message":"feat(tri-lane): 1.11.0 — advisor evidence at the merge gate; production failures classified by cause; environment retries no longer escalate (Wave 4 T45/T46)\n\nlane-worktree remove refuses (exit 4) when a lane left a diff and no advisor.md exists; --skip-advisor \"<reason>\" is recorded and logged as advisor: none below the mandatory tier (Sol, >150 lines, scope/exec-config touches, audit-trigger paths), where no skip is accepted. lane_failures gains causes (cache-miss, sandbox-denied, service-unavailable, build-timeout, test-failure, scope-violation, empty-diff, deletion-only, stall, refused-by-instruction, schema, quota) and classify_run(run_dir); lane-eval classify --production [--all-projects] appends to failures.jsonl idempotently. lane-route suggest --cause infra|harness|quota retries on the same lane instead of escalating. Project roots configurable (TRI_LANE_PROJECT_ROOTS). First histogram over the 142 production run dirs committed to docs: 0 cache-miss, 16 sandbox-denied (loopback), 7 service-unavailable; the private-cache lifecycle stays held. 6 new tests (48), self-test 12 checks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WT9CrntRggfay145hQCxpJ","tree":{"sha":"e642dd14bbc4ed89f73e93212b0c069cb74f8c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/e642dd14bbc4ed89f73e93212b0c069cb74f8c1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/731d170151d98e8f508263f50dc1643a8dbf2ede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","follo