anizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/830ef31a15c9891d677cb115f2864e8af6f59ff4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:15:16Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:19:43Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"message":"feat(tax): add the tax domain (12 skills + CPA benchmark) and the tax-analyst agent\n\nPorts the tax skill library into skills/tax/ as doctrine only: client facts,\nfiled-return figures, and private engine identifiers removed; engine references\nuse the binding names in TAX-PROFILE-TEMPLATE.md. Adds professional-liability\ndisclaimers, corrects the §174A/§195 rule for pre-revenue R&E, pins indexed\nfigures to a tax year, and ports repo-activity.sh to stdlib repo_activity.py\nwith a cure-repo-activity wrapper.\n\nAdds the tax-analyst agent: no Write/Edit (disallowedTools; Bash limited by instruction), no agent\nmemory by design, preloads cpa-standards + irc-lookup, drafts workpapers for\nCPA review and never files. ops-finance now hands tax work to tax-analyst\n(Delaware dates corrected). Also adds solicitation-triage and\nbuyer-intelligence, and names all 9 domains in the manifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EP4LEjgZx9S2uYpAnWNbXd","tree":{"sha":"494984ecddc28277f42ea422a9691bdbf2a4a34d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Grou