busercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/91247df630ac5e804a1fd61b8701f074b9a0f915/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T00:06:51Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T00:06:51Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"message":"fix(tri-lane): implementer wrapper: cached preflight, Gradle VERIFY, commit on behalf, deletion guard, status for all lanes (1.9.2)\n\nCloses #53.\n\n- lane-preflight.py: writes a session marker; --cached MINUTES reuses an ok\n  result, so parallel lanes stop repeating the architect''s once-per-session\n  preflight out of their own budget.\n- codex-implementer: 25 -> 40 turns; cached preflight; single `wait`, never a\n  poll loop; refuses past turn 10 with no dispatch; never warms caches.\n- lane-report.py: Gradle commands run VERIFY with the sandbox network open\n  (its lock listener needs a loopback socket the sandbox denies; writes stay\n  confined; recorded in GAPS); --verify-network forces it. A deletion-only\n  diff for a FILES path is `refused` with VERIFY skipped. --commit commits the\n  lane''s diff on the lane branch after the run, because the worktree''s git\n  metadata lives outside the codex sandbox.\n- lane-worktree.py: `status` without --task lists every lane and exits 3 if\n  any is alive.\n- SKILL.md, lanes.md, failure ledger updated; five new unit tests (34 pass);\n  self-test ok.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DwSxJmkV1JbhmK5LBHPE5f","tree":{"sha":"48d40333d38fcc415c96c72e30af13626defe5f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/48d40333d38fcc415c96c72e30af13626defe5f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/91247df630ac5e804a1fd61b8701f074b9a0f915","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commit/91247df630ac5e804a1fd61b8701f074b9a0f915","node_id":"C_kwDORh8o4doAKDkxMjQ3ZGY2MzBhYzVlODA0YTFmZDYxYjg3MDFmMDc0YjlhMGY5MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commit/bb3590d9a1c4bfe006a1d794a9d303d69e2c8334","sha":"bb3590d9a1c4bfe006a1d794a9d303d69e2c8334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/bb3590d9a1c4bfe006a1d794a9d303d69e2c8334"}],"sha":"91247df630ac5e804a1fd61b8701f074b9a0f915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/91247df630ac5e804a1fd61b8701f074b9a0f915"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/bb3590d9a1c4bfe006a1d794a9d303d69e2c8334/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T23:54:14Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T23:54:14Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"message":"fix(tri-lane): persist advisor verdicts, forbid sibling-status claims (1.9.1)\n\nCloses #51.\n\n- cure-advisor: gains Write, maxTurns 10 -> 15, writes $RUN/advisor.md\n  before answering, and must reach a verdict from incomplete reading by\n  turn 10 with the unreached questions under MISSING. It was the only\n  lane with no output file and the smallest budget for the most reading.\n- SKILL.md Step 3: every parallel brief carries \"report only your own\n  work; you cannot see other agents\"; sibling-status claims are stripped\n  before a report is quoted. Ad-hoc research briefs name an output path\n  under $RUN.\n- SKILL.md Step 4: on a turn-limit or partial notification, ls $RUN before\n  resuming; the three lanes usually finished and the result is on disk.\n- lanes.md: ADVISOR=\"$RUN/advisor.md\".\n- Failure ledger: three harness classes recorded and closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DwSxJmkV1JbhmK5LBHPE5f","tree":{"sha":"8e94b384c3c716609aaa2e60e26a9a048dfc3532","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/8e94b384c3c716609aaa2e60e26a9a048dfc3532"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/bb3590d9a1c4bfe006a1d794a9d303d69e2c8334","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https: