/api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/commits/0466cb939fc602e1a746ce1032fdc7302a7f236e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:05:28Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:05:28Z","email":"rashad.cureton@gmail.com","name":"Rashad Cureton"},"message":"feat(product): add design-studio skill for brand identity and Adobe/Figma hand-off\n\nConsolidates the design-studio and brand-identity-design drafts into one skill\n(skills/product/design-studio) and prepares it for distribution:\n\n- SKILL.md: when_to_use + argument-hint, $STUDIO path convention for Claude Code\n  and Gemini/Antigravity installs, confirm-before-execute step for the Adobe\n  bridge, disable-model-invocation (the bridge runs code inside Adobe apps).\n- bridge_macos.sh: only \"Adobe Illustrator\"/\"Adobe Photoshop\"; app and path passed\n  as AppleScript argv (no string interpolation); refuses scripts without #target\n  or with shell/network/eval/include primitives.\n- export_asset_matrix.py: stdlib + macOS sips/qlmanage only (Pillow removed);\n  stdlib multi-resolution .ico writer; brand book embeds the SVG as an image and\n  escapes the brand name (closes stored-XSS path).\n- figma_sync.py: token from FIGMA_TOKEN only, dry-run by default (--apply to\n  publish), file-key validated.\n- Illustrator template: brandName sanitised in the save path, read-only doc.name\n  assignment removed, current CC compatibility enum. Photoshop template refuses\n  linked Smart Objects.\n- Removed composite_mockup.py (Pillow-only), the client-specific benchmarks\n  folder, and the stale gemini skills/claude-bootstrap.skill.\n- evals: t17-t19 design tasks registered under design-studio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DwSxJmkV1JbhmK5LBHPE5f","tree":{"sha":"06b38d9c59f769b559ec5c466723dbcf076f2b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/trees/06b38d9c59f769b559ec5c466723dbcf076f2b39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cure-Consulting-Group/ProductEngineeringSkills/git/commits/0466cb939fc602e1a746ce1032fdc7302a7f236e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16387538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rcureton","id":16387538,"login":"Rcureton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg3NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rcureton/subscriptions","