nyectar_cambios_v4` entry point for dynamic state modification.\n- Refactored `index.html` to include `#scene-wrapper`, ensuring fixed UI elements are not broken by 3D perspective.\n- Integrated draggable manual JSON injector panel.\n- Developed AI Assistant (`src/ai_assistant.js`) using `@google/genai` via ESM.run for browser compatibility.\n- Assistant is configured as \"Arquitecto de Impulsa\" with tool-call capabilities for automatic UI injection.\n- Fixed ''Failed to resolve module specifier'' error by using CDN-based ESM imports.\n- Updated `package.json` with necessary dependencies.\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"60079f132a9a6b4a3e21cc4e34bdd97264ff6794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/60079f132a9a6b4a3e21cc4e34bdd97264ff6794"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/bdabbb679f6f0929f4513bafde9a277772d0b228","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starr