d `z-index`.\n- Implemented an Advanced Background and Border Panel: Features a dropdown for selecting solid colors, gradients, or image URLs, alongside isolated inputs for border width, style, and color.\n- Added a Filters and Effects Manager: Introduced specific sliders for `blur`, `brightness`, `sepia`, and a dedicated native input for `backdrop-filter` to visually build Glassmorphism.\n- Constructed a Visual Shadow Manager: Added a dedicated, scoped UI component that breaks down `box-shadow` into visual sliders (X, Y, Blur, Spread), an Inset toggle, and a color picker, ensuring it operates independently of 3D Transform controls.\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5debb3e05fc965cd49a4870b953270972afbceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/a5debb3e05fc965cd49a4870b953270972afbceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/c4803184611b691a27f79d1e3f68e5c9fea2e654","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.githu