hub.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/commits/104eba10be386bd655f7d98c8324efef479eb211/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T09:31:45Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T09:31:45Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Upgrade Editor to WYSIWYG Spatial Builder\n\n- Implemented Direct Visual Selection: Clicking any generated element inside the `iframe` preview automatically selects its corresponding JSON node in the Editor tree and opens the properties inspector.\n- Injected `data-path` tracking to dynamically map DOM nodes to JSON paths in `showcase.js`.\n- Added global click interceptor in Editor Mode to prevent default link/accordion behaviors while selecting, alongside a subtle purple dashed outline feedback.\n- Introduced Structural Manipulation Tools: Users can now Move Up (↑) and Move Down (↓) nodes to reorder them in the JSON layout.\n- Upgraded Component Templates modal to allow inserting new components as \"Children\" or \"Siblings\" (Before/After) relative to the currently selected node.\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1175c2299a1ca74dee725754ea732e105f45cccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/1175c2299a1ca74dee725754ea732e105f45cccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/104eba10be386bd655f7d98c8324efef479eb211","verification":{"payload":n