e the true power of the Vanilla JS spatial engine.\n- Implemented a Deep Space Parallax Hero with nested `translateZ` layers.\n- Built a fully CSS-based 3D interactive phone (''El Prisma Teléfono'') featuring an internal V4 scroll engine on its screen to simulate an internal app.\n- Added a responsive Bento Grid demonstrating the custom `hover-hermanos` directive.\n- Updated `showcase.js` to parse text as `innerHTML` to allow span styling directly from JSON (e.g. gradient texts).\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7283f03bd9d35c0f35507a9c98d1e2b8066abab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/7283f03bd9d35c0f35507a9c98d1e2b8066abab0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/2a7945cf9d25045adb659fbf293a201983627190","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","