rucciones específicas para desplegar estáticamente en Firebase Hosting y conectar el motor de guardado de estado a Firestore (Firebase DB) para lograr sincronización en tiempo real sin backend dedicado.\n- Se documentaron las buenas prácticas de seguridad (Firebase Auth) recomendadas para proteger el Panel de Administración de accesos no autorizados mediante el atajo de teclado antes de pasar a producción.\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d45ddc0e5c8e7bdbf77ac13194b423c7c80f28ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/d45ddc0e5c8e7bdbf77ac13194b423c7c80f28ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/b450e1ad985dee8582731160b91a8973b239192d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D"