[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T23:46:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: implementar Navegación Espacial Inmersiva (Fase 15 FINAL)\n\nSe completó exitosamente la Fase 15 y el proyecto completo:\n- Implementación de `activeMicroPage` en Zustand (useStore).\n- Creación de `MicroPageModal.jsx`, permitiendo abrir ventanas y vistas secundarias (ej. detalles de proyecto, contacto) flotando sobre el mundo 3D sin cambiar la URL ni recargar el navegador, logrando la inmersión total.\n- Conexión del evento onClick en los modelos 3D (`PhoneDemo3D.jsx`) con el `ActionBuilder`, despachando eventos de \"click_phone\" y manipulando el cursor dinámicamente.\n- Eliminación del código muerto y archivo huérfano `Scene.jsx` tras la estabilización de `SceneClient.jsx`.\n- Actualización final y completada al 100% del `CHECKLIST.md`.\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e7f014daa1ca395f086112ac18b2407870b6cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/4e7f014daa1ca395f086112ac18b2407870b6cbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/bc7e05df3a40267eddd46e219797545eeec619aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"goog