om/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/commits/2e1f114177cabaa617cd490f8781ac48fa0f78d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:50:24Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:50:24Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: implementar Factory Pattern y JSON Schema dinamico (Fase 2)\n\nSe completó la Fase 2 del Checklist para el Showroom Impulsa Studio:\n- Rediseño de src/config.js para usar un JSON Schema basado en un array de \"sections\".\n- Creación de src/components/react/SectionRenderer.jsx para mapear y renderizar dinámicamente el HTML en base al estado de Zustand.\n- Refactorización de src/pages/index.astro eliminando el HTML estático duro; ahora la vista depende exclusivamente de <Scene /> y <Navigation />.\n- Limpieza total de CameraManager.jsx y Scene.jsx: Se eliminó todo código de manipulación imperativa del DOM (querySelectorAll, getElementById, gsap.to) delegando la visibilidad a estilos inline reactivos.\n- Actualización de src/components/react/ConfigPanel.jsx para que sus inputs modifiquen correctamente el nuevo schema anidado de secciones en Zustand.\n\nCo-authored-by: gabqc77s-spec <228850938+gabqc77s-spec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"623f174d3ec7781abc8a0940f3dbde77411929a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/trees/623f174d3ec7781abc8a0940f3dbde77411929a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabqc77s-spec/istudio/git/commits/2e1f114177cabaa617cd490f8781ac48fa0f78d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D