BAPTISTE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T10:54:15Z","email":"alexandre.baptiste@capgemini.com","name":"BAPTISTE"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive AI agent documentation\n\n- Add complete README.md with 8 sections (stack, architecture, installation, build, execution, tests, structure, contribution)\n- Add docs/product-requirements.md with extensive PRD (objectives, features, users, specifications)\n- Add .github/.github/copilot-instructions.md with general coding standards (style, architecture, tests, documentation, accessibility, security, communication, multi-lingual)\n- Add .github/instructions/ folder with language-specific guidelines:\n  * csharp.instructions.md (ASP.NET Core 9, Dapper patterns, no EF/Repository, BCrypt, JWT)\n  * vuejs3.instructions.md (Vue 3 Composition API, Pinia, TypeScript, Tailwind)\n  * sql.instructions.md (SQL Server, Dapper parameterized queries, snake_case, indexes)\n- Add .github/prompts/ folder with analysis guides:\n  * analyse-de-securite.prompt.md (OWASP Top 10, authentication, injection, XSS/CSRF, secrets, dependencies)\n  * analyse-de-accessibilite.prompt.md (WCAG 2.1 Level AA, keyboard navigation, screen readers, contrast)\n\nAll documentation written in French for GitHub Copilot and future developers/AI agents.","tree":{"sha":"09602beab9e467da07a3db279d19b61c3017f1bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexandreBaptiste/specify-pomodoro/git/trees/09602beab9e467da07a3db279d19b61c3017f1bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlexandreBaptiste/specify-pomodoro/git/commits/2c2c95ba2e86535cb3489ea0dc178601aa160eb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexandreBaptiste/specify-pomodoro/commit/2c2c95ba2e86535cb3489ea0dc178601aa160eb1","node_id":"C_kwDORiLr0toAKDJjMmM5NWJhMmU4NjUzNWNiMzQ4OWVhMGRjMTc4NjAxYWExNjBlYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlexandreBaptiste/specify-pomodoro/c