neado con el nuevo criterio del backend (validado o completado, ya no propuesta)\n- BibliotecaMicroretos.vue: grid de familias a 3 columnas, familias destacadas fijas arriba y resto agrupado tras \"Ver más familias\"\n- router/index.js: nueva ruta /retos/familias\n- MicroretoModal.vue: muestra la pregunta del reto junto al subtítulo y renombra la etiqueta a \"Este reto consiste en responder a:\"\n- DetalleMicroreto.vue: mismo cambio de pregunta del reto y etiqueta que en MicroretoModal\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e400a22c504daed290b0e36ffd9c80d4eea0b6c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/e400a22c504daed290b0e36ffd9c80d4eea0b6c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/8519b6253971477a6f96e7d02f0eefe982bc1f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/c