junto al código de acceso en card y modal (naranja, distintivo ✨), botones renombrados\n- MisGrupos.vue: refleja también ambos códigos por encuentro\n- EquipoWorkspace.vue: botones \"Sugerir con IA\" bloqueados hasta introducir el código del docente\n- DesbloquearIaModal.vue (nuevo): modal de código para el alumnado\n- AccesoEmpresasModal.vue, DbSecurityModal.vue: adaptados a skipAuthRedirect\n\nDB:\n- add_codigo_ia_to_encuentros_table, add_ia_desbloqueada_to_equipos_table\n- add_transversal_to_microretos_table, rename_transversal_to_multimodulo_in_microretos_table, rename_transversal_value_to_ambos_cursos_in_microretos","tree":{"sha":"ac0bbd398623e8d2388c2f5c98237751c6558d54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/ac0bbd398623e8d2388c2f5c98237751c6558d54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/3fe7817de070d2f59e9b8bf2296d9d9ea985fee7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_