ssionHovered), panel de notas estilo sticky con add/remove,\n  computed ultimosProyectosEnCurso, importa CatalogoBoeModal\n- StartupDayDetalle.vue: acciones rápidas en grid de 2 columnas, botón \"Mi cuenta\"\n  → /mi-usuario, navegación de mes en calendario con hover states\n- SidePanel.vue: elimina botón \"Mi usuario\", simplifica rolHome() (docente → /inicio-docente,\n  resto → /microretos), elimina import ROLE_ADMIN no usado\n\nDocs:\n- CLAUDE.md: instrucciones de proyecto para Claude Code\n- FABLAB_MICROPROYECTOS_SPEC.md, docs/fablab-gap-analysis.md: spec y análisis de gap FABLAB","tree":{"sha":"fcd8dc178e6a2dbead708ed95223be5938383f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/fcd8dc178e6a2dbead708ed95223be5938383f0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/92b771d00ad2f2e998d6d6087a8137e9810800e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http