gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/361f5c47f07fce892cd2fe305177cc709a5eb049/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T07:51:23Z","email":"cynthiamartelmartin@gmail.com","name":"Cynthia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T07:51:23Z","email":"cynthiamartelmartin@gmail.com","name":"Cynthia"},"message":"feat: panel docente, sidebar permanente, seguridad y migraciones de BD\n\nBackend:\n- EnsureIsSuperAdmin: nuevo middleware para operaciones exclusivas de superadmin\n- app/Http/Requests/: FormRequests de validación por acción\n- AdminAuthController, AdminUserController: autenticación y CRUD de usuarios\n  con distinción de scope admin-de-centro vs superadmin\n- MicroretoIAController, SesionController: ajustes y correcciones\n- EnsureIsAdmin: actualizado para reconocer isSuperAdmin()\n- User, Sesion: nuevas relaciones (empresa, centroEducativo), campos empresa_id\n- bootstrap/app.php: registro de nuevos middlewares\n- DatabaseSeeder: actualizado con datos de prueba completos\n- Migración add_user_id_to_sesiones: FK user_id en tabla sesiones\n- Migración add_empresa_id_to_users: campo empresa_id en tabla users\n- routes/api.php: nuevos endpoints admin con middleware EnsureIsSuperAdmin\n- lang/: soporte base de traducciones Laravel\n- SECURITY_FIXES.md: documentación de correcciones de seguridad aplicadas\n\nFrontend:\n- SidePanel: panel permanente en desktop (hidden lg:flex), sin toggle móvil,\n  nueva sección Panel docente (/inicio-docente), usa useLoginModal composable\n- TopBar: logo DuaLab navega a /inicio-docente para docentes/admins (irHome),\n  eliminado emit toggle-panel\n- App.vue: contenido con lg:pl-64 para offset de sidebar, AppCredit montado siempre\n- InicioDocente.vue: nueva vista de panel de inicio para docentes y admins\n- useLoginModal.js: composable para gestión centralizada del modal de login\n- router/index.js: nueva ruta /inicio-docente con meta requiresAuth\n- stores/auth.js: actualizaciones de estado y comprobaciones de rol\n- GestionUsuarios: panel de administración de usuarios revisado y funcional\n- DashboardDocente, GeneradorMicroretos, GeneradorMicroretos2,\n  Home, StartupDayProyectos: ajustes de layout y compatibilidad con nuevo sidebar","tree":{"sha":"c8b94761c0ca897d90ed56c02fa5a2539f24010a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/c8b94761c0ca897d90ed56c02fa5a2539f24010a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/361f5c47f07fce892cd2fe305177cc709a5eb049","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User