thub.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/0d7a12d3d7e8fb929f174bbeb3745620bad5585a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:44:23Z","email":"cynthiamartelmartin@gmail.com","name":"Cynthia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:44:23Z","email":"cynthiamartelmartin@gmail.com","name":"Cynthia"},"message":"feat(auth+ui): sistema de roles con gestión de usuarios y nav condicional  Backend: - 3 migraciones: role (1=admin,2=docente,3=empresa), is_blocked + softDeletes,   FK centro_educativo_id en users - User: constantes ROLE_*, SoftDeletes, helpers de rol, relación centroEducativo - Login rechaza bloqueados y no activados (403), devuelve role y name - Nuevo middleware EnsureIsAdmin registrado como alias ''admin'' - AdminUserController: CRUD con activar, bloquear, papelera, restaurar, asociar centro - Rutas /admin/usuarios protegidas con middleware admin - SesionController: docentes con centro solo ven sesiones de su centro  Frontend: - auth.js: ROLE_*, ROLE_ROUTES, canAccess(), roleLabel, userName; login/logout   persisten y limpian role y name; refresh no sobreescribe rol - Router: meta.roles en todas las rutas, guard de rol, nueva ruta /admin/usuarios - SidePanel: nav condicional por canAccess(); modal bienvenida animado por rol;   redirección al home del rol tras login - LoginModal: título genérico, pasa role y name al store - GestionUsuarios: nueva vista de admin con tabla, filtros, acciones y tooltip guiado - EmpresasView: chips de estadísticas de contacto, centros colapsados por defecto - DashboardDocente: headers de sección, botón Ver sesiones rediseñado - SesionesRegistradas: acordeón por centro en lugar de paginación","tree":{"sha":"e8bc63bea47d64c0e6307ebd3dd6de7567fce5eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/e8bc63bea47d64c0e6307ebd3dd6de7567fce5eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/0d7a12d3d7e8fb929f174bbeb3745620bad5585a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/0d7a12d3d7e8fb929f174bbeb3745620bad5585a","node_id":"C_kwDORiQ0y9oAKDBkN2ExMmQzZDdlOGZiOTI5ZjE3NGJiZWIzNzQ1NjIwYmFkNTU4NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4","sha":"940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4"}],"sha":"0d7a12d3d7e8fb929f174bbeb3745620bad5585a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/0d7a12d3d7e8fb929f174bbeb3745620bad5585a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fen-Sauer","id":190630087,"login":"Fen-Sauer","node_id":"U_kgDOC1zIxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/da26f5bc1737d02f8431daeaf7e648a6bc86429b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:37:30Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:37:30Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"message":"update: al modificar una propuesta ya aceptada por una empresa, al temrinar de modificarla hay que enviar devuelta una verificación a la empresa y que ésta te la acepte\n\nBackend:\n\nMicroproyectoController.php — update(): si el proyecto ya está validado por la empresa (empresa_validado = true), el método compara el valor actual en base de datos con el nuevo valor enviado para cada campo de contenido relevante (titulo, empresa_id, datos_empresa, datos_centro, equipo, modulos_seleccionados, ra_ce, fundamentacion, diseno_reto, diseno_microproyecto, resumen, objetivos, kpis). Si alguno de estos campos ha cambiado, se añade al payload empresa_validado = false y validacion_empresa = null antes de persistir, forzando una nueva validación. Los campos administrativos (curso, sesion_id, ciclo_id, familia_id, centro_id, estado, paso_actual) no afectan al estado de validación.\n\nFrontend — Vistas actualizadas:\n\nStartupDayWizard.vue:\n\nAñadida ref proyectoValidado que se inicializa al cargar el proyecto desde el campo empresa_validado de la respuesta de la API\nLa función guardar() actualiza proyectoValidado en tiempo real con el valor empresa_validado devuelto por el servidor tras cada guardado, de modo que el banner reacciona inmediatamente si el servidor ha reseteado la validación\nAñadido banner de aviso en la barra de progreso superior, visible únicamente cuando proyectoValidado es true, que advierte al usuario de que modificar el contenido del proyecto requerirá una nueva validación por parte de la empresa; el banner desaparece automáticamente en cuanto el servidor confirma el reset","tree":{"sha":"484bffe7ded38e44796bfdffd8d7b330a12aa60d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/484bffe7ded38e44796bfdffd8d7b330a12aa60d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/da26f5bc1737d02f8431daeaf7e648a6bc86429b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fen-Sauer","id":190630087,"login":"Fen-Sauer","node_id":"U_kgDOC1zIxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/da26f5bc1737d02f8431daeaf7e648a6bc86429b","node_id":"C_kwDORiQ0y9oAKGRhMjZmNWJjMTczN2QwMmY4NDMxZGFlYWY3ZTY0OGE2YmM4NjQyOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c","sha":"12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c"}],"sha":"da26f5bc1737d02f8431daeaf7e648a6bc86429b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/da26f5bc1737d02f8431daeaf7e648a6bc86429b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fen-Sauer","id":190630087,"login":"Fen-Sauer","node_id":"U_kgDOC1zIxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:49:51Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:49:51Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"message":"fix: mejor actualizacion de RA y CE y mejor aplicados, mayor concreción de datos del proyecto en sus detales y en el formuario enviado a empresas,\n\nBackend:\n\nMicroproyectoController.php — showByToken(): ampliado el payload público devuelto a la empresa, que ahora incluye datos_centro, fundamentacion, diseno_microproyecto, kpis, modulos_seleccionados, ra_ce, resumen y un objeto reto_origen con campos relevantes del microreto vinculado (titulo, quien_es, dia_a_dia, que_necesitan, dificultades). La relación microreto se carga con eager loading.\n\nFrontend — Vistas actualizadas:\n\nStartupDayWizard.vue:\n\nSelección manual de RA/CE: añadido watch sobre modulos_seleccionados que recarga el catálogo automáticamente si el modo activo es manual o ia, sin necesidad de salir y volver a entrar al modo\nSelección manual de RA/CE: añadido watch profundo sobre ceChecked que regenera form.ra_ce en tiempo real al marcar/desmarcar criterios, sin necesidad de pulsar \"Aplicar\"\nBotón \"Siguiente →\" del paso 4 (Currículo): aplica automáticamente la selección manual si hay CEs marcados sin aplicar antes de avanzar al paso siguiente\nNavegación por pasos: añadido pasoMaxAlcanzado que registra el paso más alto visitado; los botones superiores permiten saltar a cualquier paso ya visitado, no solo hacia atrás\n\nStartupDayDetalle.vue:\n\nAñadida computed raCeBlocks que parsea el texto ra_ce con formato estructurado [Módulo]\\nRA:...\\nCE:\\n •... en bloques\nNueva tarjeta RA/CE: muestra bloques estructurados (módulo en verde, RA en negrita, CEs con bullet ámbar) o texto libre con whitespace-pre-wrap si no sigue el formato\nNueva tarjeta \"Docente responsable\" con inicial como avatar, nombre, email clicable y nombre del centro + municipio\n\nStartupDayLanding.vue (portal de validación empresa):\n\nLa ficha del proyecto ahora incluye: resumen ejecutivo, contexto y fundamentación (con elemento innovador), entregables del reto, necesidades e dificultades del reto origen, fases del proyecto con duración, KPIs, módulos FP como pills y docente responsable con datos de contacto\nNueva tarjeta independiente para RA/CE con el mismo parser estructurado del detalle, con fallback a texto libre\nEl docente aparece con avatar de inicial, email mailto: clicable, y centro educativo alineado a la derecha","tree":{"sha":"e9e706c5bd2d1966bfc7d1d06f9d7013785c4203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/e9e706c5bd2d1966bfc7d1d06f9d7013785c4203"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fen-Sauer","id":190630087,"login":"Fen-Sauer","node_id":"U_kgDOC1zIxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c","node_id":"C_kwDORiQ0y9oAKDEyZThlYjUzYjQ2ZDMzNDQzZTZlZDQ3ZGNkMmY5NTcxZTYwZGY5OWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/5aed04014b7c8fbaf8d3978b1c17705cba51c4e2","sha":"5aed04014b7c8fbaf8d3978b1c17705cba51c4e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/5aed04014b7c8fbaf8d3978b1c17705cba51c4e2"}],"sha":"12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/12e8eb53b46d33443e6ed47dcd2f9571e60df99c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fen-Sauer","id":190630087,"login":"Fen-Sauer","node_id":"U_kgDOC1zIxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/5aed04014b7c8fbaf8d3978b1c17705cba51c4e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:49:01Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:49:01Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"message":"update: Se ha añadido una capa de seguridad más a la hora de eliminar/modificar/añadir empresas y centros educativos en el apartado de base de datos, teniendo que introducir una contraseña que se tiene que renovar cada 30 minutos\n\nFrontend — Nuevos archivos:\n\nuseDbSecurity.js: composable singleton que gestiona la seguridad de mutaciones en BD. Requiere verificación de contraseña cada 30 minutos antes de cualquier creación, edición o eliminación. Almacena el timestamp en sessionStorage.\n\nDbSecurityModal.vue: modal de verificación de contraseña de administrador. Distingue entre contraseña incorrecta (muestra error, permite reintentar) y sesión Sanctum expirada (limpia token y redirige al login).\n\nFrontend — Archivos modificados:\n\nauth.js: el login() inicializa el timer de seguridad de BD en sessionStorage, evitando que pida contraseña inmediatamente tras iniciar sesión.\n\napi.js: añadida /admin/verify-password a la lista de exclusiones del interceptor de 401. Una contraseña incorrecta en el modal ya no cierra la sesión del usuario (igual que ya existía para /empresas/verificar-acceso).\n\nBaseDatosDashboard.vue: los 6 triggers de mutación (pedirNuevoCentro, pedirEditarCentro, pedirEliminarCentro, pedirNuevaEmpresa, pedirEdicion, pedirEliminacion) son ahora async y comprueban requireDbSecurity() antes de abrir cualquier diálogo. Añadido <DbSecurityModal> al template.\n\nCentroEducativoModal.vue: corregido bug que redirigía a / al recibir un 401 durante la creación de un centro. Ahora muestra el mensaje de error dentro del propio modal sin cerrar la sesión.","tree":{"sha":"76f7b7b51dc852fb3094b44934765910673850e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/76f7b7b51dc852fb3094b44934765910673850e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/5aed04014b7c8fbaf8d3978b1c17705cba51c4e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-S