"email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T12:22:30Z","email":"gabi712004@gmail.com","name":"Fen-Sauer"},"message":"fix: ampliación y soluciones a la nueva función de papelera y recuperación de datos\n\nBackend:\n\nMicroproyecto.php y Sesion.php: añadido trait SoftDeletes — los borrados ahora son recuperables\nMigración: columna deleted_at añadida a tablas microproyectos y sesiones (ya aplicada)\nPapeleraController.php: soporte completo para tipos proyectos y sesiones (listar, restaurar, eliminar permanentemente, vaciar). Incluye limpieza de relaciones al borrar permanentemente (recursos del proyecto, desvinculación de microproyectos de sesión)\n\nFrontend — Nuevos componentes:\n\nEliminarProyectoModal.vue: doble confirmación (fase impacto + título exacto)\nEliminarSesionModal.vue: doble confirmación (fase impacto + escribir \"ELIMINAR\")\n\nFrontend — Vistas actualizadas:\n\nStartupDayProyectos.vue: reemplazado confirm() por el modal seguro + snackbar con \"Ir a la papelera\" + botón papelera junto a \"Guía\"\nSesionesRegistradas.vue: reemplazado borrado inmediato sin confirmación por el modal seguro + snackbar con \"Ir a la papelera\" + botón papelera en el header\nPapeleraBaseDatos.vue: añadidos tipos proyectos (violeta) y sesiones (rosa) con sus iconos y etiquetas","tree":{"sha":"192d866d56fdcf358868b7294a81439bd91c67a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/192d866d56fdcf358868b7294a81439bd91c67a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/ba5b2fabb7ec7daf93ddb0482d4cad33cc44e8db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190630087?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fen-Sauer","id":190630087,"login":"Fen-Sauer","node_id":"U_kgDOC1zIxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fen-Sauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/ba5b2fabb7ec7daf93ddb0482d4cad33cc44e8db","node_id":"C_kwDORiQ0y9oAKGJhNWIyZmFiYjdlYzdkYWY5M2RkYjA0ODJkNGNhZDMzY2M0NGU4ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commit/940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4","sha":"940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4"}],"sha":"ba5b2fabb7ec7daf93ddb0482d4cad33cc44e8db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/ba5b2fabb7ec7daf93ddb0482d4cad33cc44e8db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/commits/940be95bd12e1bfa87214fb32830f281c7abcda4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:38:39Z","email":"cynthiamartelmartin@gmail.com","name":"Cynthia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:38:39Z","email":"cynthiamartelmartin@gmail.com","name":"Cynthia"},"message":"eat: sistema de papelera con soft delete para la sección base de datos\n\nBackend:\n- Migración: añade deleted_at a empresas, microretos, ciclos_formativos,\n  familias y centro_educativo\n- Modelos: SoftDeletes en los 5 modelos — Laravel filtra deleted_at\n  automáticamente en todas las queries y relaciones\n- PapeleraController: GET /papelera (lista agrupada por tipo),\n  PATCH /papelera/{tipo}/{id}/restaurar, DELETE /papelera/{tipo}/{id}\n  y DELETE /papelera (vaciar, acepta ?tipo= para filtrar por tipo)\n- El forceDelete limpia pivots y FKs huérfanas solo en borrado permanente\n- DatosFPController: simplifica eliminarEmpresa y eliminarCentro para\n  preservar relaciones y permitir restauración íntegra desde papelera\n- api.php: rutas de papelera dentro de auth:sanctum\n\nFrontend:\n- PapeleraBaseDatos.vue: lista por tipo con tabs, fechas relativas,\n  restauración optimista por item y modales de confirmación para\n  borrado permanente y vaciado (requiere escribir VACIAR)\n- router/index.js: ruta /papelera con requiresAuth\n- SidePanel.vue: enlace Papelera en sección Administración","tree":{"sha":"ffdd1c43d12a86a2bf4854cf75980027963038c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/ffdd1c43d12a86a2bf4854cf75980027963038c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cynthi