d): modales de onboarding, tour guiado y refactor de config\n\nFrontend:\n- Nuevos componentes: AccesoEmpresasModal, BienvenidaModal_DashboardDocente,\n  CatalogoBoeIntroModal\n- EmpresasView: modal de acceso extraído, onboarding con opciones y filtro\n  por centro educativo\n- BaseDatosDashboard: intro modal antes del catálogo BOE, contadores de\n  familias/ciclos en zona de peligro\n- GeneradorMicroretos: tour guiado por pasos usando useUIState\n- SidePanel: elimina secciones colapsables, simplifica navegación\n- BienvenidaModal renombrado a BienvenidaModal_DashboardDocente\n- CatalogoBoeModal y GestionFamiliasCiclosModal: usan ciclos_count en lugar\n  de carga lazy\n\nBackend:\n- config/services.php: centraliza Cloudinary, empresas y admin (env → config)\n- DatosFPController: añade withCount(''ciclos'') en getFamilias\n- UploadController y EmpresaContactoController: sustituyen env() por config()\n- DatabaseSeeder: credenciales via config(), quita ''familias'' del truncate\n- Migración sync_all_familias para mantener familias BOE actualizadas\n- deploy.sh: script de despliegue para Hostinger","tree":{"sha":"0b4f72af20727119ecc2f0bea9c43d727f93cd66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/0b4f72af20727119ecc2f0bea9c43d727f93cd66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/9de6fb9953790f241321f1399b06d5d9bbab1bdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id"