roModal para gestión\n  completa desde la vista de base de datos\n- Generador: centro educativo obligatorio como primer paso; empresa deshabilitada hasta\n  elegir centro y filtrada por él; brillo animado por pasos y overlay con guía ①②③\n- Generador: botón flotante \"volver arriba\" en paso 3; nivel del microreto renombrado\n  con descripción de exigencia (Básico/Medio/Alto) en lugar de ejemplos por curso\n- Biblioteca y Detalle: badge muestra \"Nivel microreto: X\" para evitar confusión\n  con nomenclatura de ciclos (GM/GS)\n- Dashboard docente: modal de ficha de microreto y detalle de sesión integrados;\n  cabecera mejorada\n- Panel lateral: secciones colapsables, modal de info y navegación unificada con irA()\n- Nuevos componentes: MicroretoModal, EliminarEmpresaModal\n- Fix de conflicto en github","tree":{"sha":"4657f7938fb5581815c23b193d9492dc6de523b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/trees/4657f7938fb5581815c23b193d9492dc6de523b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CynthiaMartel/microretos/git/commits/4e4ab9909bff969f60504f52e45b4ecc932e5b4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172623274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CynthiaMartel","id":172623274,"login":"CynthiaMartel","node_id":"U_kgDOCkoFqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CynthiaMartel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyn