.com/users/riki-k-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/commits/df7545c7749e08e62bb83ed66241718dd4962a26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T14:24:45Z","email":"xonic.code@gmail.com","name":"Riki Kashyap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T14:24:45Z","email":"xonic.code@gmail.com","name":"Riki Kashyap"},"message":"ui: implement full mobile responsiveness across dashboard components\n\n- Layout & Navigation:\n  - Added mobile hamburger menu in `DashboardLayout`.\n  - Implemented an animated mobile drawer overlay in `Sidebar` using Framer Motion.\n  - Ensured body scroll locks when the mobile menu is open.\n\n- Forms & Submissions Lists:\n  - Fixed action buttons (edit, delete, view) visibility on touch devices by defaulting to `opacity-100` on mobile and enabling hover-states only on `md:` breakpoints.\n\n- WhatsApp Flows:\n  - Replaced fixed heights with responsive scaling (`min-h-[500px] lg:h-[600px]`).\n  - Added `truncate` and `min-w-0` to chat headers to prevent layout breakage on small screens.\n  - Optimized button text sizes for narrow viewports.\n\n- Form Schema Editor:\n  - Refactored header to stack vertically (`flex-col`) on mobile.\n  - Implemented `flex-wrap` for form field settings (type select, required checkbox, delete button) to prevent horizontal squishing.\n  - Disabled drag-to-reorder handle on mobile for better touch experience.","tree":{"sha":"e22ce78075ea7428a739b953d25a85ba2d92ea2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/git/trees/e22ce78075ea7428a739b953d25a85ba2d92ea2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/git/commits/df7545c7749e08e62bb83ed66241718dd4962a26","verification":{"payload":n