c.code@gmail.com","name":"Riki Kashyap"},"message":"feat(docs): implement interactive developer documentation page\n\n- Built the complete `app/docs/page.tsx` with a layout consistent with the main dashboard (collapsible sidebar, top navigation header).\n- Integrated `IntersectionObserver` for scroll-spy functionality, automatically highlighting the active section in the sidebar as the user scrolls.\n- Created a reusable, sleek `CodeBlock` component with copy-to-clipboard functionality for better Developer Experience (DX).\n- Added comprehensive documentation sections: Introduction, Authentication (Security warnings for API keys), API Reference (cURL & Next.js Server Action examples), Webhooks, and WhatsApp Flows.\n- Applied smooth entrance animations using Framer Motion and updated classes to align with Tailwind v4 standards.\n- Optimized layout with hidden scrollbars for a clean, premium SaaS aesthetic.","tree":{"sha":"36705b9e0b9e30204427f6af2401dda4dfa6baf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/git/trees/36705b9e0b9e30204427f6af2401dda4dfa6baf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/git/commits/74ebb0c03392a8c97ccba9e4197ec5e7d05526be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180072102?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/riki-k-dev","id":180072102,"login":"riki-k-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCruupg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/repos","