02,"login":"riki-k-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCruupg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/commits/f6133c8c2bcba8b59761f661940186b2c0c827f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T13:22:49Z","email":"xonic.code@gmail.com","name":"Riki Kashyap"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T13:22:49Z","email":"xonic.code@gmail.com","name":"Riki Kashyap"},"message":"fix(core): resolve template generation, state sync, UI skeletons, and independent WhatsApp status\n\nDatabase & Schema:\n- Added independent ''whatsappStatus'' column to forms table to prevent main form lockout when disabling WA flow.\n\nBackend & APIs:\n- fix(templates): Updated template generator to set form status to ''active'' by default.\n- fix(templates): Injected template ''name'' and ''description'' into the JSON schema for correct Builder UI mapping.\n- feat(notifications): Added activity logging for standard web form submissions via public API.\n- feat(notifications): Created lightweight ''/api/user/unread'' endpoint to check for unread activities.\n- fix(whatsapp): Updated status toggle API and Meta webhook to use the new independent ''whatsappStatus'' column.\n\nFrontend & UI/UX:\n- fix(templates): Updated template library fields to use ''name'' instead of ''id'' to map correctly with the form engine.\n- feat(ux): Implemented route-specific React Suspense skeleton loaders for all dashboard pages (Overview, Forms, Submissions, API, WA, Integrations, Templates, Settings) to eliminate layout shift and improve perceived performance.\n- fix(state): Added useEffect hooks in FormsClient and WhatsAppClient to dynamically sync React state after server-side router.refresh().\n- feat(ui): Added dynamic unread notification indicators (blue dot) to the global profile avatar and settings tab.\n- fix(css): Refactored avatar layout wrapper to perfectly position the notification badge (half-inside, half-outside) without clipping.","tree":{"sha":"2cdf5c6ca9389b4e4c49782d9c5f30a9f4389fd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/git/trees/2cdf5c6ca9389b4e4c49782d9c5f30a9f4389fd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riki-k-dev/formix/git/commits/f6133c8c2bcba8b59761f661940186b2c0c827f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180072102?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/riki-k-dev","id":180072102,"login":"riki-k-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCruupg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riki-k-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/riki-k-dev/formix/commit/f6133c8c2bcba8b59761f661940186b2c0c827f7","node_id":"C_kwDORiYcCdoAKGY2MTMzYzhjMmJjYmE4YjU5NzYxZjY2MTk0MDE4NmIyYzBjODI3Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/riki-k-dev/f