lish still bundled\nPOC_EXPERIMENTS.md, REBUILD_PLAN.md, setup_poc.sh, and docs/findings/\n(client-specific dogfood notes) despite them being gitignored, since they\nwere never tracked and pub doesn''t fully honor .gitignore for untracked\nfiles. .pubignore is what actually controls publish inclusion. Also\nexcludes docs/superpowers/ (internal plan/spec docs) from the package\nwhile keeping them in git for project history. Verified via\n`dart pub publish --dry-run` before this fix landed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2e7ae8dbd1c767be425aa0095e309104b3cb53d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/trees/c2e7ae8dbd1c767be425aa0095e309104b3cb53d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/commits/f2178b43325b6621f2224be1b9069e3c212a3e50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58895720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC","id":58895720,"login":"LuanCesarDC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODk1NzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/commit/f2178b