s_in_flow_control_structures, fix all 7 violations\n- Format 4 files, remove one unused import (dart pub static analysis: 50/50)\n- Loosen analyzer upper bound so pub get resolves to 12.1.0 instead of a\n  stale 10.2.0 lock, without adopting the breaking analyzer 14.x AST API\n- Untrack .dart_sentinel/baseline.json (already gitignored, was left\n  tracked from the earlier hooks dogfood commit)\n- Gitignore internal working notes (POC_EXPERIMENTS.md, REBUILD_PLAN.md,\n  setup_poc.sh, docs/findings/) — not part of the published package\n- README: add table of contents + \"where do I start\" quick nav, link\n  Claude Code Hooks section to the analyzer.yaml prerequisite\n- Bump version to 0.3.0, changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbd093ea6e4794ecaf3ea376d642801ca094b375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/trees/dbd093ea6e4794ecaf3ea376d642801ca094b375"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/commits/8a52c78cd622c866ee5df9bd9667740eaca592e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58895720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC","id":58895720,"login":"LuanCesarDC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODk1NzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions