"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T18:22:57Z","email":"luancesardc99@gmail.com","name":"LuanCesarDC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T18:22:57Z","email":"luancesardc99@gmail.com","name":"LuanCesarDC"},"message":"Add lazy null check rule and improve existing rules\n\n- Implemented `LazyNullCheckRule` to detect lazy null coalescing patterns that silently swallow null values.\n- Enhanced `PassthroughFunctionRule` for better readability and consistency.\n- Refactored `RedundantCommentsRule` to improve regex patterns and streamline logic.\n- Updated `SingleMethodClassRule` for better readability and maintainability.\n- Improved `VerboseLoggingRule` to enhance clarity in logging checks.\n- Refactored utility functions in `GlobMatcher` and `GraphUtils` for better readability.\n- Cleaned up test cases in `dead_todo_plugin_test.dart` for consistency.\n- Enhanced `SentinelFixContributor` and `SentinelPlugin` for better error handling and reporting.","tree":{"sha":"c4a041f77e58054852cfe9f2ab89a8c1ccab438b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/trees/c4a041f77e58054852cfe9f2ab89a8c1ccab438b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/commits/fbc4a5b221530eac3dc95d701175438b634de208","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58895720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC","id":58895720,"login":"LuanCesarDC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODk1NzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luan