ngle_method_class_plugin_rule, and verbose_logging_plugin_rule.\n- Each test checks for specific linting conditions and expected diagnostics.\n\nfeat: implement Sentinel plugin for custom analysis\n\n- Created a new analyzer plugin that reports custom diagnostics for Dart code.\n- Implemented checks for empty catch blocks, dead TODO comments, generic naming, single-method classes, verbose logging, passthrough functions, and redundant comments.\n- Added quick fix contributions for identified issues.\n\nchore: add plugin entry point and fix contributor\n\n- Added main entry point for the analyzer plugin.\n- Implemented SentinelFixContributor to provide quick fixes for diagnostics.\n- Enhanced the plugin to handle custom diagnostics and provide relevant fixes.","tree":{"sha":"9d10e57ae3738a0ff1793c1ec2b4ff5724364bf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/trees/9d10e57ae3738a0ff1793c1ec2b4ff5724364bf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/commits/30d4253116a50c890a69755910eb1c9c1c84ee7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58895720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC","id":58895720,"login":"LuanCesarDC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODk1NzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h