g, single-method-class, and passthrough-function.\n- Updated README and analyzer configuration to include new rules and their descriptions.\n- Enhanced the analyzer to support AI Slop Detection with tunable configurations for each rule.\n- Implemented individual rule classes for dead todos, empty catch blocks, generic naming, verbose logging, single method classes, and passthrough functions.\n- Improved project context and runner to accommodate new rule categories and ensure proper execution.","tree":{"sha":"6df82d83b78d838568cf9d8d51bfd16f19d9a574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/trees/6df82d83b78d838568cf9d8d51bfd16f19d9a574"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/git/commits/967543d57292319a454550c64a39618ffb3c636e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58895720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC","id":58895720,"login":"LuanCesarDC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODk1NzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuanCesarDC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuanCesarDC/dart-sentinel/commit/967543d57292319a454550c64a39618ffb3c636e","node_id":"C_kwDORi